  dc510b4c-d968-4d10-8a79-4b3681eca1d9:
    id: dc510b4c-d968-4d10-8a79-4b3681eca1d9
    content: '"There are a few reasons I built Arborescent"'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
  73826fab-623c-4633-8295-5d3a455906ff:
    id: 73826fab-623c-4633-8295-5d3a455906ff
    content: AI can build whole projects, but when it goes wrong it goes very wrong. In mature production projects, that's not an acceptable risk. I needed a way to ensure I had creative and technical oversight — that what I was building would do what I wanted, that I could understand what was built, and that it would scale.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
  6d0f72a2-abcf-4dd3-be3d-fa220fba7f14:
    id: 6d0f72a2-abcf-4dd3-be3d-fa220fba7f14
    content: Vibe coding is risky as it trades creative and technical control for speed
    children:
      - 73826fab-623c-4633-8295-5d3a455906ff
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
  1525e317-b993-424b-bb9a-cc4a6b901f14:
    id: 1525e317-b993-424b-bb9a-cc4a6b901f14
    content: Requirements are scattered across multiple sources, and translating them into AI prompts involves a lot of repetition. Each company has different preferences, and getting the AI the right context at the start of every session is time-consuming. I needed something that bridged the gap between structured thinking and AI-assisted workflows.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
  80b87eb0-42cf-4f2a-bb6c-ede27c70514a:
    id: 80b87eb0-42cf-4f2a-bb6c-ede27c70514a
    content: Context and workflow management is now the main productivity bottleneck
    children:
      - 1525e317-b993-424b-bb9a-cc4a6b901f14
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
  68a44aed-18ad-493f-b4e1-74fe46aa6810:
    id: 68a44aed-18ad-493f-b4e1-74fe46aa6810
    content: AI is a great skill multiplier, but if we stop hiring juniors we lose the talent pipeline. Everyone deserves interesting work and the chance to grow. I wanted a way to encode domain experience and share it with beginners so they can be productive from day one.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
  4e31a4be-fcea-4ded-8d67-4626e8589e11:
    id: 4e31a4be-fcea-4ded-8d67-4626e8589e11
    content: Junior developers need a way to stay relevant with AI workflows
    children:
      - 68a44aed-18ad-493f-b4e1-74fe46aa6810
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      resolvedAt: '2026-02-18T09:21:21.550Z'
