  ee471c75-ae59-41c9-bf39-b397ee00355f:
    id: ee471c75-ae59-41c9-bf39-b397ee00355f
    content: The idea of blueprints is that you can share and refine them with your team, or open source them to share with a community. If you have blueprints you would like to share, you can make a merge request to add them to the project defaults.
    children: []
