  fc5ac5bc-abbb-4c6e-9152-83563715531f:
    id: fc5ac5bc-abbb-4c6e-9152-83563715531f
    content: 'Undo of the start-move: starting a node at workflow root moves it to step 1; if the user undoes this move, the execution state and node position diverge — since execution state is transient and non-undoable, undo should also pause the execution'
    children: []
