  feca7147-a993-4430-b6b1-b9b523b2c527:
    id: feca7147-a993-4430-b6b1-b9b523b2c527
    content: 'Highest defect likelihood: overlay positioning — CSS conflicts with existing left-positioned overlays are fragile across node content widths and step number digit counts'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  d0eedc5c-6b59-42c5-8a34-e59cfbe4dbc4:
    id: d0eedc5c-6b59-42c5-8a34-e59cfbe4dbc4
    content: 'Highest defect likelihood: Escape key context detection — distinguishing "editing" from "not editing" depends on focus state and contentEditable, which can be unreliable'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  8a2098b4-1d8e-4d95-8d4c-0f3ef2126bbc:
    id: 8a2098b4-1d8e-4d95-8d4c-0f3ef2126bbc
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: terminal assignment tracking — leaked assignments block future starts with no user-visible recovery path'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  e6d80d02-55c3-4c65-a3e6-e6ca25715c00:
    id: e6d80d02-55c3-4c65-a3e6-e6ca25715c00
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: startup recovery — if Running state persists across restart without recovery, orphaned overlays confuse the user with no way to clear them'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  ae586219-0f8f-4821-89fd-82419fd8ac81:
    id: ae586219-0f8f-4821-89fd-82419fd8ac81
    content: 'Dependency: terminal store has no "AI assistant running" detection — tests for terminal availability must mock this; real behavior depends on how this is resolved'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  e10c87fb-6550-432b-8b60-d7e3249e9b29:
    id: e10c87fb-6550-432b-8b60-d7e3249e9b29
    content: 'Ambiguous requirement: "completion" is referenced but undefined — test plan covers pause and terminal-close release paths, but completion-triggered release cannot be tested until the trigger is specified'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  b3041bf0-01e1-4078-b578-5c365297f6d6:
    id: b3041bf0-01e1-4078-b578-5c365297f6d6
    content: 'Likely to change: overlay positioning and icon choices may shift after visual review — keep CSS tests minimal and rely on manual visual validation'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
