  354d224e-fcc8-4de3-ad78-dbd36b712190:
    id: 354d224e-fcc8-4de3-ad78-dbd36b712190
    content: 'Session-to-terminal correlation depends on env var inheritance — if the AI tool spawns in a subprocess that doesn''t inherit env, the terminal_id is lost. Mitigation: document requirement that AI tool must run directly in the Arborescent terminal'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  2ca5404e-bdd3-4d6d-ab90-6cb376d2d494:
    id: 2ca5404e-bdd3-4d6d-ab90-6cb376d2d494
    content: 'Claude Code hooks API is an external dependency — payload format and event names could change between versions. Mitigation: isolate payload parsing behind an adapter so only one file needs updating'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9279799c-a3e6-486a-b5f6-a5cfd7f4f3e2:
    id: 9279799c-a3e6-486a-b5f6-a5cfd7f4f3e2
    content: 'Port conflicts if another instance of Arborescent is running or port is occupied. Mitigation: retry with incremental ports, surface the active port clearly in UI'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  a90affe2-af25-4316-9af0-39196abaaeba:
    id: a90affe2-af25-4316-9af0-39196abaaeba
    content: 'Race condition: terminal created before server starts. Mitigation: start server before registering terminal handlers in `createWindow()`; env vars reference the port that was actually bound'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  02a367c7-d2a2-47ab-aafe-ca3bc632bae0:
    id: 02a367c7-d2a2-47ab-aafe-ca3bc632bae0
    content: Auth token leaks to child processes of the terminal. Risk is low (localhost only, single-user machine) but worth noting. The token is ephemeral (regenerated per app session)
    children: []
    metadata:
