      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  cca1fc3b-ed1d-4bca-befb-e783cb8b4930:
    id: cca1fc3b-ed1d-4bca-befb-e783cb8b4930
    content: 'High value — this is the feature that turns Arborescent from "outliner with AI" into "AI workflow orchestrator," which is the stated objective. Effort is significant but modular: each piece (output modes, archiving, tree scale) can ship independently.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  ca0c2df9-22bd-46b8-bfde-1cf85a74a6b4:
    id: ca0c2df9-22bd-46b8-bfde-1cf85a74a6b4
    content: Estimate effort relative to user value
    children:
      - cca1fc3b-ed1d-4bca-befb-e783cb8b4930
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  7b5102cf-5965-4e17-8e6d-63464b9943f6:
    id: 7b5102cf-5965-4e17-8e6d-63464b9943f6
    content: Cost does not outweigh benefit. However, building everything at once would be risky. The output mode choice (create output vs replace) is foundational and should be proven before automating pipelines on top of it.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  133cf927-f4ff-4709-be99-8fa3a3a45647:
    id: 133cf927-f4ff-4709-be99-8fa3a3a45647
    content: Warn if the cost likely outweighs the benefit
    children:
      - 7b5102cf-5965-4e17-8e6d-63464b9943f6
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  ec5499a4-e54a-444c-8b05-e9cdd359909a:
    id: ec5499a4-e54a-444c-8b05-e9cdd359909a
    content: 'Risk 1: AI output format consistency — mitigated. The existing hardcoded format instructions and error validation already handle this. The same system applies to "create output" mode.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: abandoned
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  ca7d750c-2684-4635-acdc-e3b5bca8e522:
    id: ca7d750c-2684-4635-acdc-e3b5bca8e522
    content: 'Risk 2: Runaway automation — autonomous workflows that create nodes which trigger further workflows could cascade unpredictably. Need circuit breakers (depth limits, node count limits, explicit user gates).'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  2cb7dbbc-2d03-4ad1-8e7a-c68154dfb7d8:
    id: 2cb7dbbc-2d03-4ad1-8e7a-c68154dfb7d8
    content: 'Risk 3: Tree scale — if decomposition generates hundreds of nodes per run, the single-file YAML format and in-memory tree will degrade. This is a prerequisite investigation, not a blocker.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  984bf9a9-19f9-4eaa-ac17-a65da8d4cdfd:
    id: 984bf9a9-19f9-4eaa-ac17-a65da8d4cdfd
    content: 'Risk 4: Hyperlink stability — operations that regenerate node UUIDs could break hyperlink references. Code analysis identified three operations that reassign IDs:'
