  c7360927-a5d1-4766-89ec-ccda10f8ff16:
    id: c7360927-a5d1-4766-89ec-ccda10f8ff16
    content: 'Multi-output advancement: output nodes are created in order and dropped into the next step. They sit there as regular nodes. A "recurse" option on a step handles sequential processing — when a node passes through a recurse step, the system walks back up the step chain through any unbroken sequence of automated steps, finds the first step in that chain, and checks if another node is waiting there. If so, it starts the next one. This decouples multi-output creation from multi-output processing. If the chain hits a checkpoint or manual step, recursion stops naturally.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  d685b995-70ec-4963-9923-b11b4a2aacc7:
    id: d685b995-70ec-4963-9923-b11b4a2aacc7
    content: 'Feedback panel with automated steps: there is no feedback panel for autonomous steps. The system watches the temporary file and updates the tree directly — user beware.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  9b695a13-d93a-44c3-a362-3e7d1c3ceb0b:
    id: 9b695a13-d93a-44c3-a362-3e7d1c3ceb0b
    content: 'Execute mode: execute mode cannot create or edit content in Arborescent, it only sends to external tools for coding. Not relevant to the input/output model.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  bcc604d9-cb93-4e51-b906-b7b388f8db41:
    id: bcc604d9-cb93-4e51-b906-b7b388f8db41
    content: 'Provenance display: provenance links are shown under a collapsible first child node, not inline below node content. Keeps the tree clean by default.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  3ab39c30-ad03-4cad-a583-d4c1f88ee173:
    id: 3ab39c30-ad03-4cad-a583-d4c1f88ee173
    content: 'Step dialog click target: step numbers are now almost as large as blueprint icons. Clicking the step number opens the configuration dialog.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  a25e49a5-9d19-4bed-a279-3f9b4eed5317:
    id: a25e49a5-9d19-4bed-a279-3f9b4eed5317
    content: 'Provenance circularity: the existing hyperlink recursion prevention system will be reused for provenance chains. Although chains are acyclic by definition, a user could theoretically feed an output back as input creating a loop, which would crash the app without protection.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  fb30f7c5-9a4b-4a90-aabe-1d6e19b37aca:
    id: fb30f7c5-9a4b-4a90-aabe-1d6e19b37aca
    content: Resolved design questions
    children:
