      isBlueprint: false
  173a0548-e447-412e-88d7-f088a32c1175:
    id: 173a0548-e447-412e-88d7-f088a32c1175
    content: 'Multi-output queue visibility: nodes move through workflow steps physically, so the user can see where each output is in the workflow. No separate queue indicator needed.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  e6c5fa2e-2c03-4198-b60f-2ecf3943fd0c:
    id: e6c5fa2e-2c03-4198-b60f-2ecf3943fd0c
    content: 'Multi-output interruption: handled by existing workflow stop behavior — the node being processed stays in the step it''s in when the workflow is stopped. The user can continue from there.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  4f1f087a-d64d-47e0-bdc4-93fdbe4b7d32:
    id: 4f1f087a-d64d-47e0-bdc4-93fdbe4b7d32
    content: '"Archive input to" timing with multi-output: input is archived immediately after the step produces its output. It does not wait for all outputs to complete their journey through subsequent steps.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  3c051234-f3d6-49a5-8ef3-38d5ddb6d4e9:
    id: 3c051234-f3d6-49a5-8ef3-38d5ddb6d4e9
    content: 'Provenance child node protection: the provenance child is deletable. Deleting it breaks the chain. This is undoable. User beware.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  99ccf663-f580-4bc9-9011-3339b9746a9d:
    id: 99ccf663-f580-4bc9-9011-3339b9746a9d
    content: 'Provenance in blueprint export: no special treatment needed. Provenance lives on working nodes, not structure, so blueprints will rarely carry it. If a user exports a blueprint that happens to include provenance, it shouldn''t break anything — just an uncommon edge case that doesn''t warrant extra logic.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  be6cd133-4491-4604-af62-895d0d35c70d:
    id: be6cd133-4491-4604-af62-895d0d35c70d
    content: 'Autonomous "create output" risk: the step configuration dialog shows a warning when risky configurations are detected — e.g. an autonomous step with "create output" and no "archive input to" set warns of data loss risk (the input could be replaced or lost without the user reviewing). Similar to the existing autonomous step type warning.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  ed25313f-e95d-4bf8-859e-c7c26654d1f6:
