  a3007c80-1b7a-4ea8-93be-12a9d8f41d12:
    id: a3007c80-1b7a-4ea8-93be-12a9d8f41d12
    content: Currently, feedback always produces a single root node that replaces the collaborating node one-to-one. "Create output" needs to produce multiple sibling nodes (e.g. 5 user stories from 1 problem statement). This requires a new acceptance path that creates multiple top-level nodes in the tree rather than replacing a single node.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
