  41bb794e-6823-43b8-accf-11d9a2df6474:
    id: 41bb794e-6823-43b8-accf-11d9a2df6474
    content: 'Alternative 1: Manual child creation — user manually creates child nodes from feedback content using copy/paste, then runs each through the workflow individually. Works today but defeats the purpose of automation.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  063cd2b7-0ad3-4f54-8812-14bf4adc62b6:
    id: 063cd2b7-0ad3-4f54-8812-14bf4adc62b6
    content: 'Alternative 2: Duplicate before sending — user duplicates the node before sending for feedback, keeping the original as a sibling. Low-tech but loses the parent-child relationship and clutters the tree.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
  0790abfe-a221-406a-9cce-f8026876be21:
    id: 0790abfe-a221-406a-9cce-f8026876be21
    content: 'Alternative 3: Use execute mode instead of collaborate — skip the feedback panel entirely and have the AI write directly to files. Works for code generation but not for tree decomposition.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
      isBlueprint: false
