    id: 0e08022c-562f-4d2e-81cb-53f8488453f1
    content: As a user building multi-step AI workflows, I need to configure per-step settings (step type, and upcoming features like archive destination and recurse) in a single place. Currently, step type is buried in a right-click submenu under Blueprint → Step Type, and as more per-step options are added, nested context menus become unwieldy and hard to discover.
