  db92dd37-2364-4244-856b-a830e95f3884:
    id: db92dd37-2364-4244-856b-a830e95f3884
    content: 'Add a popup dialog that opens when clicking a workflow step number, initially showing only step type selection. The dialog uses an overlay+popover pattern similar to CustomizeDialog but positioned near the clicked step number. Step type changes reuse the existing SetStepTypeCommand for undo support and the existing toast warnings for autonomous/checkpoint. The step number span in NodeContent.tsx gains a click handler (removing pointer-events: none) and the dialog is managed via a lightweight Zustand store.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
