  c9f33e5c-eb61-4f5e-b2d8-5b314ce04266:
    id: c9f33e5c-eb61-4f5e-b2d8-5b314ce04266
    content: As a user, I need the feedback system to be able to create multiple sibling nodes from a single AI response (e.g. 5 user stories from 1 problem statement). Currently, feedback always produces a single root node that replaces the collaborating node one-to-one. There is no path to create multiple sibling nodes from a single feedback interaction.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
