  421e0767-e1f8-4f5f-b195-2d17389ddecc:
    id: 421e0767-e1f8-4f5f-b195-2d17389ddecc
    content: 'AI returns multiple roots when decomposition is off: rejected by validation (rootNodes.length !== 1). Feedback is silently discarded. User sees no feedback panel. This is the current behavior.'
