  66eb2782-765d-48e5-b886-1766da50ff3d:
    id: 66eb2782-765d-48e5-b886-1766da50ff3d
    content: Arborescent prioritizes low cognitive load, minimal visual noise, and predictable behavior. Toast notifications are interruptive — they appear in a separate part of the screen and demand attention. Now that step type selection happens inside a focused dialog, the warning information should live where the user is looking.
    children: []
