  e4786dcc-c716-4326-a62f-a01a4c85a522:
    id: e4786dcc-c716-4326-a62f-a01a4c85a522
    content: The user is configuring workflow steps. When they select Autonomous or Checkpoint, a toast appears explaining the behavior. This is disruptive — the user has to context-switch from the dialog to the toast, read it, then return to the dialog. The information would be better presented inline where the selection happens.
