      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  cc6d22c2-ef49-4f27-b019-018d6d9653b0:
    id: cc6d22c2-ef49-4f27-b019-018d6d9653b0
    content: The AI completes the step with a compromised result. The workflow advances to the next step using bad input. The user discovers the problem only after reviewing the final output and has to backtrack manually.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  3ef57efd-1903-4b4d-a900-8b8583fe5f8d:
    id: 3ef57efd-1903-4b4d-a900-8b8583fe5f8d
    content: Flag if the problem is symptoms of a deeper issue
    children:
      - a9bbfdf4-43a3-4451-96bd-892950d0b313
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  a9bbfdf4-43a3-4451-96bd-892950d0b313:
    id: a9bbfdf4-43a3-4451-96bd-892950d0b313
    content: No deeper issue. The hook system was designed for the AI to signal completion. Extending it to signal "needs attention" is a natural progression of the same architecture.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  25c42d42-4224-41c9-92bf-5944af9ca03d:
