  ae99bab8-f53e-4a71-8205-9b2c400efdb2:
    id: ae99bab8-f53e-4a71-8205-9b2c400efdb2
    content: Very low effort — the hook infrastructure, event handling, and persistent toast system all exist. The main work is adding a new event name handler and including the instruction in context prompts. High value for autonomous workflow reliability.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  3a4c7ab3-bd18-4841-993e-b53994135db6:
