  bf22e207-322f-43ec-b24c-cf81c651de1e:
    id: bf22e207-322f-43ec-b24c-cf81c651de1e
    content: The AI must be instructed via context to use this capability. If the context doesn't mention it, the AI won't know it can flag issues. This means the feature's usefulness depends on the user's context design.
    children: []
