      plugins: {}
  38c0d413-8de6-4abc-ad13-ab66cf07fa5c:
    id: 38c0d413-8de6-4abc-ad13-ab66cf07fa5c
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: prompt injection for autonomous steps — must correctly detect step type at send time, not at workflow start time (step type could theoretically change mid-run, though unlikely)'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  245b3eb6-372e-4a59-9030-5c65b7da9ea1:
    id: 245b3eb6-372e-4a59-9030-5c65b7da9ea1
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: Stop handler flag check — if the flag is not checked, autonomous steps advance with bad output. If the flag is always true (stuck), all autonomous steps become checkpoints.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9d3f17af-f65b-4794-937d-56f47aeb22a0:
    id: 9d3f17af-f65b-4794-937d-56f47aeb22a0
    content: 'Dependency: the NeedsReview instruction relies on terminal environment variables being set. If hooks are not configured, the AI can''t call the endpoint — but the workflow still advances normally, which is the safe default.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  bab2b610-fedf-46b0-9db4-f9704f52d541:
    id: bab2b610-fedf-46b0-9db4-f9704f52d541
    content: 'Ambiguity: the exact wording of the NeedsReview instruction for the AI needs tuning to avoid false positives (AI calling NeedsReview too often) — this is a prompt engineering concern, not a code concern.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
