  614f1e7a-0243-4b10-b0f0-69a282a1cf07:
    id: 614f1e7a-0243-4b10-b0f0-69a282a1cf07
    content: Problem statement
    children:
      - d2f1c260-e171-433a-9927-5bc92a532807
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  d2f1c260-e171-433a-9927-5bc92a532807:
    id: d2f1c260-e171-433a-9927-5bc92a532807
    content: As a user running multi-step AI workflows, I want the option to keep a backup of my original input before it gets replaced by AI-generated output. Currently, accepting feedback always destroys the original content. I need to preserve it and trace which output came from which input. I also need processed inputs moved out of the workflow to keep steps tidy.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f3bdfabc-6e15-408b-94ff-8a9ca5cc40da:
    id: f3bdfabc-6e15-408b-94ff-8a9ca5cc40da
    content: Use cases
    children:
      - 6a86e578-f09f-423a-9db4-cc175748e629
      - 93f194b4-f755-4597-9798-baffe2e458a6
      - 12549477-5460-4e69-b16c-8c1d8742e279
      - 93ed3be2-d16f-4c20-8bc1-7b8b4217a36a
      - 9694c100-cf2a-41f9-b91b-d7bfa0d6e6c5
      - 03140d2c-b22b-494f-9ac2-6929e8c77bc2
      - 7b3dbd6b-38de-4f02-8f10-a7a684caec44
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  6a86e578-f09f-423a-9db4-cc175748e629:
    id: 6a86e578-f09f-423a-9db4-cc175748e629
    content: 'Primary: User configures a workflow step with "archive input to" set to a destination node, and configures the two relation link names in the step dialog. When the step processes an item, the original node is moved to the top of the destination before feedback creates replacement node(s) in its place. A collapsible child node (titled with the configured archive-side name) is added to the archived original containing hyperlink(s) to each replacement. A collapsible child node (titled with the configured replacement-side name) is added to each replacement containing a hyperlink back to the archived original.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  93f194b4-f755-4597-9798-baffe2e458a6:
    id: 93f194b4-f755-4597-9798-baffe2e458a6
    content: 'Secondary: User expands the relation child on a replacement node to see its origin, clicks the hyperlink, and navigates to the archived original.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  12549477-5460-4e69-b16c-8c1d8742e279:
    id: 12549477-5460-4e69-b16c-8c1d8742e279
    content: 'Secondary: User expands the relation child on an archived input to see all replacements that were created from it.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  93ed3be2-d16f-4c20-8bc1-7b8b4217a36a:
    id: 93ed3be2-d16f-4c20-8bc1-7b8b4217a36a
    content: 'Secondary: User leaves "archive input to" unset. No archive is made — feedback replaces the node as today (current behavior preserved).'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9694c100-cf2a-41f9-b91b-d7bfa0d6e6c5:
    id: 9694c100-cf2a-41f9-b91b-d7bfa0d6e6c5
    content: 'Secondary: The archive destination node has been deleted. A warning toast appears to tell the user, and the workflow is paused.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  03140d2c-b22b-494f-9ac2-6929e8c77bc2:
    id: 03140d2c-b22b-494f-9ac2-6929e8c77bc2
    content: 'Secondary: User deletes a relation container node or its hyperlink child. The link chain breaks but the operation is undoable.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  7b3dbd6b-38de-4f02-8f10-a7a684caec44:
    id: 7b3dbd6b-38de-4f02-8f10-a7a684caec44
    content: 'Secondary: User enables "resolve linked content when sending" for a step. When a replacement node is sent to AI, the hyperlinked archived original''s content is included in the prompt, giving the AI the original context alongside the current content.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  169be8b4-5a13-4bac-becc-6cad62f8fa9f:
