    id: b2e9add0-5596-4ca3-8a2f-b8717e9faf3e
    content: 'The step configuration dialog includes two configurable relation link names: one for the container node added to the archived original (e.g. "User stories", "Specs", "Output"), and one for the container node added to each replacement (e.g. "Problem statement", "Original", "Source")'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  69a6cd40-540e-4350-9203-393e8b2dc092:
    id: 69a6cd40-540e-4350-9203-393e8b2dc092
    content: The step configuration dialog includes a "resolve linked content when sending" toggle, default off — controls whether the archive hyperlinks resolve their linked content into AI prompts
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f0afed18-5dac-414b-bce5-c0fd2488f72d:
    id: f0afed18-5dac-414b-bce5-c0fd2488f72d
    content: 'The step configuration dialog shows a low-impact warning text (not a popup) for risky configurations: autonomous step with no archive destination warns of data loss risk'
