    content: Risks
    children:
      - b473bb5e-18fd-4f3e-bea5-08876d2a9d13
      - 8871b76b-d21c-470c-a102-0283594d38b5
      - e7a1999c-4fa2-4e5a-b0c3-d1c65393e957
      - 4f7515a7-3e9c-4828-a3ae-888cefa3a462
      - 59b37451-d441-4b50-8369-6691273b0770
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  b473bb5e-18fd-4f3e-bea5-08876d2a9d13:
    id: b473bb5e-18fd-4f3e-bea5-08876d2a9d13
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: AcceptFeedbackCommand archive undo — must correctly restore multiple state changes (node move, children arrays, relation link nodes, ancestor registry). The most complex undo path in the codebase.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  8871b76b-d21c-470c-a102-0283594d38b5:
    id: 8871b76b-d21c-470c-a102-0283594d38b5
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: partial archive — if the command creates some relation links but fails partway, the tree is left in an inconsistent state. The command must be atomic (all or nothing).'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  e7a1999c-4fa2-4e5a-b0c3-d1c65393e957:
    id: e7a1999c-4fa2-4e5a-b0c3-d1c65393e957
    content: 'Dependency: the destination picker UX affects how easily users can configure archive. A paste-hyperlink approach works but is less discoverable than a visual picker.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  4f7515a7-3e9c-4828-a3ae-888cefa3a462:
    id: 4f7515a7-3e9c-4828-a3ae-888cefa3a462
    content: 'Ambiguity: "resolve linked content when sending" — the interaction with existing hyperlink resolution in exportContextAsMarkdown needs investigation. Standard hyperlinks only resolve inside context declarations; archive hyperlinks may need to resolve in regular content too.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  59b37451-d441-4b50-8369-6691273b0770:
    id: 59b37451-d441-4b50-8369-6691273b0770
    content: 'Likely to change: the relation link name defaults and the destination picker UX may evolve based on user feedback after the MVP ships.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
