  90c76e58-235e-460f-a8fb-efda9109dd0d:
    id: 90c76e58-235e-460f-a8fb-efda9109dd0d
    content: Problem statement
    children:
      - 9fa1492f-d715-4150-8dbe-a56bf5b0801e
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9fa1492f-d715-4150-8dbe-a56bf5b0801e:
    id: 9fa1492f-d715-4150-8dbe-a56bf5b0801e
    content: As a user with automated workflows that produce multiple output nodes (e.g. 5 user stories replacing a single problem statement), I need those outputs to be processed one at a time through the remaining workflow steps. Currently, when multiple nodes sit in a step, only one can be run through the workflow at a time and the user must manually start each one.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  45a5f2a4-acbb-4910-9290-d991e167904f:
    id: 45a5f2a4-acbb-4910-9290-d991e167904f
    content: Use cases
    children:
      - 5efa22d0-2116-4d8a-b9c9-8efe15ba8c89
      - 3b241c4e-b6c6-43a3-a1c3-cffa2f5955c2
      - 886f1d73-df5e-484c-a144-a13852d63635
      - ee1f9baa-af99-4378-924d-ac6f5c4fba36
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  5efa22d0-2116-4d8a-b9c9-8efe15ba8c89:
    id: 5efa22d0-2116-4d8a-b9c9-8efe15ba8c89
    content: 'Primary: User enables "recurse" on a step in an automated chain. When a node completes that step, the system walks back up the chain to the first automated step, finds the next waiting node, and starts it. All 5 user stories are processed sequentially without manual intervention.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  3b241c4e-b6c6-43a3-a1c3-cffa2f5955c2:
    id: 3b241c4e-b6c6-43a3-a1c3-cffa2f5955c2
    content: 'Secondary: The automated chain hits a checkpoint step. Recursion stops naturally — the user must manually continue at the checkpoint and manually start the workflow for remaining items.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  886f1d73-df5e-484c-a144-a13852d63635:
    id: 886f1d73-df5e-484c-a144-a13852d63635
    content: 'Secondary: The user stops the workflow mid-sequence. The node being processed stays in its current step. The remaining unprocessed nodes stay where they are. The user can resume or restart later.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  ee1f9baa-af99-4378-924d-ac6f5c4fba36:
    id: ee1f9baa-af99-4378-924d-ac6f5c4fba36
    content: 'Secondary: Only one node is in the first step. Recurse completes and finds nothing waiting — the workflow ends normally.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
