  f861bf7b-ceff-4a3b-8e12-82b994fd3e4b:
    id: f861bf7b-ceff-4a3b-8e12-82b994fd3e4b
    content: If no waiting nodes are found, nothing happens — the workflow ends for the current item as normal
    children: []
