  710a31de-fde2-4191-b76b-e60d7e2d4852:
    id: 710a31de-fde2-4191-b76b-e60d7e2d4852
    content: 'Primary: User runs decomposition on an autonomous step with a collaborate context. The AI produces multiple items. The feedback should be accepted and the node replaced automatically, allowing the workflow to advance without intervention.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9f73d8be-8271-48a6-bcee-367ef2ff3c26:
    id: 9f73d8be-8271-48a6-bcee-367ef2ff3c26
    content: 'Secondary: Recurse picks up the next node after a decomposition step. That node enters an autonomous collaborate step. It should also auto-accept and advance, enabling a fully hands-free decompose → process pipeline.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  8cd65c58-a0e5-485f-ab29-bed374000ca0:
    id: 8cd65c58-a0e5-485f-ab29-bed374000ca0
    content: 'Secondary: Multiple autonomous collaborate steps run in parallel across different terminals. Each auto-accepts independently without blocking the others.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  3bbf1f2b-b999-4e0d-a9e2-b332a75f6f31:
    id: 3bbf1f2b-b999-4e0d-a9e2-b332a75f6f31
    content: 'Secondary: An autonomous collaborate step produces malformed output that can''t be parsed. The workflow should pause with a clear error rather than silently advancing with original content.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
