  45bb9691-acb7-4b77-808c-f14804f323e4:
    id: 45bb9691-acb7-4b77-808c-f14804f323e4
    content: The Stop hook must not advance an autonomous collaborate node until feedback has been accepted — today it advances immediately with the original content, which is a bug regardless of auto-accept
    children: []
