  5052f2d2-7a67-432e-b0ca-54846b6c75c2:
    id: 5052f2d2-7a67-432e-b0ca-54846b6c75c2
    content: The feedback file watcher is currently a singleton that can only watch one file at a time — this must be extended to support multiple concurrent watchers for autonomous collaborations
    children: []
