  163dedf0-6e7d-484d-a88d-a50a2ddf2921:
    id: 163dedf0-6e7d-484d-a88d-a50a2ddf2921
    content: The Stop hook advancing an autonomous collaborate node before feedback acceptance is a bug that exists today, independent of auto-accept — this fix is bundled because auto-accept cannot work without it
    children: []
