    id: a70e0f99-c168-47a1-83e1-1f12df84b628
    content: 'Two coordinated signals govern an autonomous collaborate step: the Stop hook (AI session finished) and the file watcher (AI response content ready). Both must arrive before the node advances.'
    children: []
