  49714403-ebd6-41a6-879c-bb54b41d234d:
    id: 49714403-ebd6-41a6-879c-bb54b41d234d
    content: As a user running autonomous workflows, I start a long-running pipeline and switch to other tasks. The app shows toasts when workflows complete or need attention, but these are invisible when the app is minimized or I'm looking elsewhere. I have no way to know something happened without periodically checking back.
