  18f5af2f-c6f9-4c86-9042-03ade390529a:
    id: 18f5af2f-c6f9-4c86-9042-03ade390529a
    content: A central notification dispatcher function is called from workflow execution at each trigger point. It checks window focus state and user preferences, then fires OS notification and/or sound as appropriate.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c95b4cd2-18c0-40f1-aba4-f7590b968798:
    id: c95b4cd2-18c0-40f1-aba4-f7590b968798
    content: OS notifications use Electron's Notification API from the main process. The renderer requests a notification via IPC; the main process creates it and handles the click callback to bring the window to the foreground.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
