  3c870c73-d1e8-4c45-b846-43cf406ffc57:
    id: 3c870c73-d1e8-4c45-b846-43cf406ffc57
    content: Linux notification support varies by desktop environment — Electron delegates to libnotify which may be absent on minimal setups. Fails silently — acceptable.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c00d4fa8-6f3f-4c81-9815-fc55a523b58c:
    id: c00d4fa8-6f3f-4c81-9815-fc55a523b58c
    content: Rapid successive notifications during recurse could flood the OS notification center. Acceptable for MVP — users can disable via preference toggle.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  d29d1546-b776-445c-b6c0-d2cba2ec4e77:
    id: d29d1546-b776-445c-b6c0-d2cba2ec4e77
    content: Small race window between isWindowFocused check and notification display if user focuses app in between. Worst case is one redundant notification — acceptable.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  dc5fae11-a0d3-41b1-926f-12cee9e542fb:
    id: dc5fae11-a0d3-41b1-926f-12cee9e542fb
    content: Electron Audio playback may fail if system audio is unavailable or muted. The .catch() handler prevents crashes.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
