  edd6e1f7-0ae7-43b6-accb-a972a15b2007:
    id: edd6e1f7-0ae7-43b6-accb-a972a15b2007
    content: Risks
    children:
      - 366fdd79-c977-4153-9da4-f5dd3c9af691
      - aa7ed03c-63eb-48ab-a28e-9b0d86c0794e
      - 366380a0-b676-4535-b6cd-bba3cd20801f
      - aa3dfd3c-bb21-4073-8f7d-388159e7c5de
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  366fdd79-c977-4153-9da4-f5dd3c9af691:
    id: 366fdd79-c977-4153-9da4-f5dd3c9af691
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: platform-specific notification behavior. Electron''s Notification API delegates to different native systems on each OS and the behavior (grouping, dismissal, sound) is not uniform. Linux support depends on libnotify being installed.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  aa7ed03c-63eb-48ab-a28e-9b0d86c0794e:
    id: aa7ed03c-63eb-48ab-a28e-9b0d86c0794e
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: notification dispatch blocking workflow execution. The dispatcher must be strictly fire-and-forget — any await or thrown error in the notification path could stall or crash workflow advancement.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  366380a0-b676-4535-b6cd-bba3cd20801f:
    id: 366380a0-b676-4535-b6cd-bba3cd20801f
    content: 'Dependency: Windows requires appId in forge.config.ts. If not configured correctly, notifications will silently fail on Windows only — this would not be caught by Linux-based development/testing.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  aa3dfd3c-bb21-4073-8f7d-388159e7c5de:
    id: aa3dfd3c-bb21-4073-8f7d-388159e7c5de
    content: 'Audio file availability: bundled wav files must be accessible at runtime. Vite''s asset handling and Electron''s packaging may place files at unexpected paths. The sound playback path must be verified after packaging, not just in dev mode.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  47d5dea1-a047-4d62-b2c0-8a29d7dc7517:
