  96aabdaa-8d3e-4df0-b85e-cf0d84fdeb2c:
    id: 96aabdaa-8d3e-4df0-b85e-cf0d84fdeb2c
    content: Focus may be on an element that is neither in the workspace nor the feedback panel (e.g., menu bar, search bar, terminal). All handlers already check isHotkeyActiveInContext which gates on the current context (tree/terminal/browser/modal). This remains the primary guard.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  786fd57a-f8ce-4a86-a79b-905166b3168b:
    id: 786fd57a-f8ce-4a86-a79b-905166b3168b
    content: The feedback panel can mount and unmount while a collaboration is active. setActiveFeedbackStore(null) on unmount ensures stale store references are cleared.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  730868bf-51c1-4300-b70b-660a60c95fca:
    id: 730868bf-51c1-4300-b70b-660a60c95fca
    content: 'HMR during development: removing the HMR workaround means listeners registered on window persist across hot reloads. If the keyboard module itself changes, listeners from the old module remain. This is acceptable — a full page reload (Ctrl+R) clears them, and the old workaround was already imperfect.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
