  97a80340-aae4-44b4-a310-77bb0f1dfadf:
    id: 97a80340-aae4-44b4-a310-77bb0f1dfadf
    content: As a user, when I right-click a node and open the Send submenu, I have to choose between "In terminal" and "In browser" every time — even though I've already opened the panel I want to use. With many contexts defined, the submenu overflows the viewport and the send actions become unreachable. The terminal/browser choice adds an unnecessary click to every send operation.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
