  f296da95-8def-46f3-be02-3f159e2f58e5:
    id: f296da95-8def-46f3-be02-3f159e2f58e5
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: the feedback panel fallback logic. This is new behavior — the old Send submenu had no concept of "active panel." The fallback needs to correctly check terminal existence via the terminal store, not panel visibility.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  56435984-5f9a-4e12-993d-da94634dc2e4:
    id: 56435984-5f9a-4e12-993d-da94634dc2e4
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: Send does nothing or sends to the wrong target. The user''s muscle memory is "right-click → Send" and they expect it to work. If the panel detection fails silently, content goes nowhere or to the wrong place.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
