    id: fe707d80-483f-4c47-8456-c42628c4dd64
    content: As a user, the "Apply context" submenu in the right-click menu shows a flat list of all my contexts without indicating their mode. Now that the Send submenu is being simplified and its context picker removed, the "Apply context" submenu needs to show contexts grouped by collaborate and execute mode so I can see which mode each context uses and access the built-in defaults ("Basic review" and "Basic execution").
