  ae43b656-4935-48e9-a3ff-2f4c4ea9f85b:
    id: ae43b656-4935-48e9-a3ff-2f4c4ea9f85b
    content: Problem statement
    children:
      - f2552a0a-ac8b-4a17-9ad4-3927fdaa785f
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f2552a0a-ac8b-4a17-9ad4-3927fdaa785f:
    id: f2552a0a-ac8b-4a17-9ad4-3927fdaa785f
    content: When a user manually advances an item to the next or previous workflow step via the context menu, the tree view scrolls to follow the item to its new location. This pulls the user away from whatever they were looking at — editing another node, reviewing a different branch — and forces them to scroll back. The disruption compounds when advancing multiple items. Automated advancement already avoids this by flashing the node and showing a toast without scrolling.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c037e7b0-36b8-469b-975a-b7c86d5f3c6f:
    id: c037e7b0-36b8-469b-975a-b7c86d5f3c6f
    content: Use cases
    children:
      - d266ff7d-8486-428c-af76-7508113c747b
      - 77dc1ded-632c-46cc-b791-ca94f535c1fa
      - 8a8e9b6e-5beb-4628-8ac9-f1bd8d04e6a0
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  d266ff7d-8486-428c-af76-7508113c747b:
    id: d266ff7d-8486-428c-af76-7508113c747b
    content: 'Primary: User right-clicks an item inside a workflow step → Next step. The item moves. The view stays where it was. A toast confirms the move.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  77dc1ded-632c-46cc-b791-ca94f535c1fa:
    id: 77dc1ded-632c-46cc-b791-ca94f535c1fa
    content: 'Secondary: User advances multiple items in succession. The view remains stable throughout — no cascading scroll jumps.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  8a8e9b6e-5beb-4628-8ac9-f1bd8d04e6a0:
    id: 8a8e9b6e-5beb-4628-8ac9-f1bd8d04e6a0
    content: 'Secondary: User advances an item to a step inside a collapsed branch. Ancestors expand so the item is reachable later, but the view does not scroll to it.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
