  ee2dda22-d2ec-45b3-8577-e082c39687ac:
    id: ee2dda22-d2ec-45b3-8577-e082c39687ac
    content: When a checkpoint step is the last step in a workflow and the AI finishes, the node enters "awaiting-validation" state with no next step to continue to. The user must right-click and select "Continue Workflow" which just completes the workflow. This is unnecessary friction — if there's nowhere to go, just complete.
