    id: 8cb03e42-6c27-4817-acfa-efdac8ee5aba
    content: When the terminal (or browser) panel is open and a collaboration starts, the feedback panel replaces it. After accepting or cancelling feedback, the panel is hidden entirely instead of returning to the terminal/browser that was open before. The user has to manually reopen the terminal, which breaks flow — especially during workflows where they're actively monitoring terminal output.
