  0c71c6c7-050b-4741-a2b2-ae953195774d:
    id: 0c71c6c7-050b-4741-a2b2-ae953195774d
    content: When a user sends content in execute mode to a terminal, the content is fired and forgotten — the AI does work but nothing comes back to the tree. The user must manually update node statuses afterward. The collaborate pipeline already has round-trip infrastructure (temp file, file watcher, feedback panel, accept/undo). Execute mode needs the same pipeline with a different prompt — one that instructs the AI to update statuses rather than rewrite content.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
