  0beac993-27ea-49d2-add9-ba062317a079:
    id: 0beac993-27ea-49d2-add9-ba062317a079
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: the routing changes in context menu and workflow execution. Two separate code paths need to converge — if one is missed, execute mode silently falls back to fire-and-forget with no error.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  7b4a32d8-31ed-4885-9074-d5cf50c68efb:
    id: 7b4a32d8-31ed-4885-9074-d5cf50c68efb
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: workflow execute steps that previously advanced on hook Stop may now stall if the AI doesn''t write to the temp file. This changes the failure mode from "works but no feedback" to "stalls waiting for feedback."'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  60c10662-7308-4e9d-bc2d-37eaa1f85e8d:
    id: 60c10662-7308-4e9d-bc2d-37eaa1f85e8d
    content: The `appendNeedsReviewInstruction` integration needs verification — if it's lost in the rerouting, autonomous steps won't pause on NeedsReview events.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
