  5424538b-36ea-4f3c-8cda-4692e8bb06f0:
    id: 5424538b-36ea-4f3c-8cda-4692e8bb06f0
    content: The browser execute prompt instructs the AI to update statuses (check off, mark failed/undone) and optionally add items, but not delete existing items or rewrite their content
