  6fc05ab5-b977-4501-8a5b-b1fd9ff626dc:
    id: 6fc05ab5-b977-4501-8a5b-b1fd9ff626dc
    content: When a user switches between arbo file tabs, the panel stays the same — showing whichever terminal, browser, or feedback panel was last opened regardless of which file is active. This means switching files doesn't give you a clean workspace for that file. The panel store needs to track which panel content is active per-file, and swap it on tab switch. This is the foundation that all other per-file panel stories depend on.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f7a05251-6eff-4c6b-a11f-b06046ceb595:
    id: f7a05251-6eff-4c6b-a11f-b06046ceb595
    content: Use cases
    children:
      - c29dbea7-dc4f-4b4a-9be8-45a38fab4ed3
      - a9728c01-f1cd-4432-954c-924e88bd9d11
      - d971750d-9c43-4f9c-9df6-5dc800ff9b98
