  ccf9a7b1-9103-4248-bf60-7d22bc3c4a24:
    id: ccf9a7b1-9103-4248-bf60-7d22bc3c4a24
    content: The panel store is currently a single global Zustand store. It needs to become file-aware — either by keying state by file path or by storing panel state on the per-file tree store.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  36a23f29-5ba6-4256-be84-2a4358d89b65:
    id: 36a23f29-5ba6-4256-be84-2a4358d89b65
    content: Terminal and browser instances remain global in this story — only the visibility/active panel content becomes per-file. Per-file terminals and browser tabs are separate stories.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1c851364-058d-45fb-a5e2-3515c4e6cc43:
    id: 1c851364-058d-45fb-a5e2-3515c4e6cc43
    content: This story does not change which terminal or browser tabs exist — it only changes which panel type (terminal/browser/feedback/null) is shown when you switch files.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
