  518705d8-d84b-4aaf-801c-22912303547e:
    id: 518705d8-d84b-4aaf-801c-22912303547e
    content: Problem statement
    children:
      - 16ab86f8-efd5-43b1-8702-a277606a34db
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  16ab86f8-efd5-43b1-8702-a277606a34db:
    id: 16ab86f8-efd5-43b1-8702-a277606a34db
    content: Terminals are currently global — all files share the same pool of terminal tabs. A terminal opened for file A is visible and usable from file B. This means workflows running in file A's terminal are visible (and interruptible) from file B. Each file needs its own set of terminals so that workflows run independently without cross-file interference.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  dbfc986a-8f24-4143-a42c-04f669f39393:
