    content: 'Primary: User opens a terminal in file A, switches to file B — the terminal panel shows no terminals (file B has none yet). User creates a terminal in file B. Both files now have independent terminals.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
