  6e70121a-1775-433d-b003-f22b3f1fc06c:
    id: 6e70121a-1775-433d-b003-f22b3f1fc06c
    content: Browser tabs are currently global — all files share the same pool of browser tabs. A browser tab opened for file A's collaboration is visible from file B. Each file needs its own set of browser tabs so that browser-based collaborations and reference browsing are scoped to the project.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
