  9dd4990c-9389-4bf2-a363-b4d6245e177b:
    id: 9dd4990c-9389-4bf2-a363-b4d6245e177b
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: the isBrowserVisible flag interaction with panelStore''s per-file activeContent. If addTab sets isBrowserVisible but the panel isn''t showing browser for the current file, the UI may be inconsistent.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1c025e7f-07b9-48ae-8d13-36441ce8f75b:
    id: 1c025e7f-07b9-48ae-8d13-36441ce8f75b
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: browser collaboration copying to clipboard and opening the wrong file''s browser panel. The clipboard collaboration path goes through panelStore.showBrowser() which is per-file, so this should be safe — but it needs manual verification.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c508254c-93b9-407e-b27d-b617af2b256f:
    id: c508254c-93b9-407e-b27d-b617af2b256f
    content: 'Session persistence: the browser store currently saves/restores a flat session. The per-file map format change must handle the legacy flat format gracefully or existing users lose their browser tabs on upgrade.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
