  e9609d75-6c73-432b-85e0-e2f97078d946:
    id: e9609d75-6c73-432b-85e0-e2f97078d946
    content: Problem statement
    children:
      - fbbee13c-7886-41a0-9644-6ead5a3c06aa
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  fbbee13c-7886-41a0-9644-6ead5a3c06aa:
    id: fbbee13c-7886-41a0-9644-6ead5a3c06aa
    content: The clipboard is a shared system resource. Browser collaboration works by copying a prompt to the clipboard and monitoring the clipboard for the AI's response. If two files both have active browser collaborations, the clipboard monitor can't distinguish which response belongs to which file. Only one browser collaboration can be active at a time across all files.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  2be16a49-d28c-45d4-b9ae-c5087d871bcd:
    id: 2be16a49-d28c-45d4-b9ae-c5087d871bcd
    content: Use cases
    children:
      - c968b7c4-4761-401d-af02-628fd99b1274
      - 4959f12c-9b10-4ac3-9ad0-b295efa5d9eb
      - 4c8bb41b-b09d-4057-8a18-bb8d627fca66
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c968b7c4-4761-401d-af02-628fd99b1274:
    id: c968b7c4-4761-401d-af02-628fd99b1274
    content: 'Primary: User starts a browser collaboration in file A. Switches to file B and tries to start a browser collaboration — a toast appears: "Browser collaboration already in progress in [file A name]." The action is blocked.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  4959f12c-9b10-4ac3-9ad0-b295efa5d9eb:
    id: 4959f12c-9b10-4ac3-9ad0-b295efa5d9eb
    content: 'Secondary: User finishes the collaboration in file A (accepts or cancels). Now they can start a browser collaboration in file B.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  4c8bb41b-b09d-4057-8a18-bb8d627fca66:
    id: 4c8bb41b-b09d-4057-8a18-bb8d627fca66
    content: 'Secondary: Terminal collaborations are unaffected — multiple terminal collaborations can run concurrently across files.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
