  a160dce5-eef2-4bd3-a78e-7bc316d8a262:
    id: a160dce5-eef2-4bd3-a78e-7bc316d8a262
    content: Risks and edge cases
    children:
      - 31e9a60d-a289-4c8f-af3a-3ccf2eaa95d9
      - 1d8066ca-e34d-49e2-9cf9-f19eec57df0f
      - 02578c58-c0e1-4147-bf0b-82ca4980b0bf
      - 61658643-6198-44c4-913c-6bb63a3c79e3
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  31e9a60d-a289-4c8f-af3a-3ccf2eaa95d9:
    id: 31e9a60d-a289-4c8f-af3a-3ccf2eaa95d9
    content: Subscribing to multiple stores from a single hook (useTabIndicators) could cause performance issues if not carefully optimized. Use Zustand selectors that return stable references, and memoize the indicator map.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1d8066ca-e34d-49e2-9cf9-f19eec57df0f:
    id: 1d8066ca-e34d-49e2-9cf9-f19eec57df0f
    content: The feedbackTreeStore is a separate store from the tree stores. Reading hasFeedback requires subscribing to feedbackTreeStore version changes, which fires for ALL files. The hook needs to be selective about which files' feedback state it checks.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  02578c58-c0e1-4147-bf0b-82ca4980b0bf:
    id: 02578c58-c0e1-4147-bf0b-82ca4980b0bf
    content: The "action required" indicator overlaps with "feedback pending" — a checkpoint step awaiting validation has feedback pending. The indicator should show the most urgent state (action required > feedback pending > workflow running) rather than all three simultaneously.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  61658643-6198-44c4-913c-6bb63a3c79e3:
    id: 61658643-6198-44c4-913c-6bb63a3c79e3
    content: Rapid state changes (workflow advancing through multiple steps quickly) should not cause indicator flicker. The hook should debounce or batch state reads.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
