    content: Toast notification for non-active file feedback — Step 4 deferred. The toast needs to fire from the feedback processing path when the receiving file isn't active. This requires careful consideration of where to fire (useFeedbackClipboard vs processIncomingFeedbackContent) and whether the path runs when the panel isn't mounted.
