  972a372e-3786-4691-97e0-d2cec252c562:
    id: 972a372e-3786-4691-97e0-d2cec252c562
    content: useTabIndicators hook replaced by tabIndicatorStore — the tech spec proposed a React hook, but the implementation uses a dedicated Zustand store (tabIndicatorStore) that tree stores push to. This avoids the hooks-in-loops problem and is more performant. The hook tests were rewritten as store tests.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: abandoned
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f27b0e5e-b77d-4c06-acd3-ea918e4c49aa:
    id: f27b0e5e-b77d-4c06-acd3-ea918e4c49aa
    content: 'feedbackPending distinction between "started" and "feedback arrived" — simplified. feedbackPending is true when collaboratingNodeId is set (any active collaboration). The hasFeedback check was dropped to avoid circular imports with feedbackTreeStore. Acceptable: the indicator shows "something is happening" which is useful regardless.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: abandoned
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  6278a66f-ff0b-449b-ae85-6babeb76e9ba:
    id: 6278a66f-ff0b-449b-ae85-6babeb76e9ba
    content: Zoom tab indicator suppression — zoom tabs get indicators via getIndicatorForFile which resolves to the parent file path. The parent file's indicator is shown. Zoom tabs don't get their own entries in the indicator store.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: abandoned
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9ee91d39-adfc-444d-a2e9-2f384b7191ae:
