  19cf4659-1e41-47c1-aa66-562978b6aeb4:
    id: 19cf4659-1e41-47c1-aa66-562978b6aeb4
    content: Risks
    children:
      - a9b01e01-ebe4-4306-b3f5-2aa723dba2be
      - 28c31f7c-a22b-422a-8bdc-ed7c0215efae
      - 4a1725f3-bcbe-417e-8d9c-832396919c67
      - 897830e7-c83a-45d1-ae1b-6937f17c66f2
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  a9b01e01-ebe4-4306-b3f5-2aa723dba2be:
    id: a9b01e01-ebe4-4306-b3f5-2aa723dba2be
    content: 'Highest likelihood of defects: the ordering of cleanup operations. Workflows must be stopped before terminals are killed, and terminals must be killed before the file is saved. If the order is wrong, the saved state may not reflect the stopped workflows, or terminal processes may be orphaned.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  28c31f7c-a22b-422a-8bdc-ed7c0215efae:
    id: 28c31f7c-a22b-422a-8bdc-ed7c0215efae
    content: 'Highest impact if failed: orphaned PTY processes. If closeFileTerminals fails or isn''t called, terminal processes run indefinitely in the background consuming system resources. The user has no way to stop them except restarting the app.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  4a1725f3-bcbe-417e-8d9c-832396919c67:
    id: 4a1725f3-bcbe-417e-8d9c-832396919c67
    content: The confirmation dialog introduces async user interaction in the close path. If the user takes a long time to respond, the file's state may have changed (new workflows started, feedback arrived). The close logic should re-check state after the dialog, not rely on the state at dialog-show time.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  897830e7-c83a-45d1-ae1b-6937f17c66f2:
    id: 897830e7-c83a-45d1-ae1b-6937f17c66f2
    content: Dependencies on three separate stores (terminal, browser, panel) being correctly wired. A missing cleanup call for any store means leaked state. Integration tests should verify all three are called.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
