    content: Workflow running confirmation dialog — Steps 1-2 (workflow check + stop) not yet implemented. The dialog requires changes to fileActions.closeFile and an Electron IPC dialog. Without this, files with running workflows close immediately without warning (terminals are still killed, just no warning). This is a UX enhancement, not a functional gap — the cleanup itself works.
