    content: Browser clipboard monitor stop — deferred. The clipboard monitor is managed by the useFeedbackClipboard React hook which stops automatically on component unmount. When the file closes and the panel unmounts, the monitor stops naturally via the hook's cleanup effect. No explicit stop needed.
