  6baf1a23-0646-46b0-97fb-7c50723362ac:
    id: 6baf1a23-0646-46b0-97fb-7c50723362ac
    content: When the app restarts, per-file panel state is partially lost. Panel visibility (which panel was open for each file) is already saved via fileStates in the panel session. Browser tabs lose their file association — they restore as a flat list not scoped to any file. Terminal state is entirely ephemeral (PTY processes can't survive restart), but the information about which files had terminals open and their working directories could be restored by spawning new terminals on startup.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
