  1fccd372-71e4-4697-9dae-f4ba1a8cff71:
    id: 1fccd372-71e4-4697-9dae-f4ba1a8cff71
    content: 'Browser persistence needs the session format extended from a flat { tabs, activeTabId } to a per-file map. The saveBrowserSession and restoreBrowserSession paths need updating. Backward compatibility: if the old flat format is loaded, assign tabs to the first/active file.'
