  3eeca9fc-91d1-4eec-b852-8f2d06f58016:
    id: 3eeca9fc-91d1-4eec-b852-8f2d06f58016
    content: Terminal persistence is new — the terminal store has no session save/restore. The format should save which files had terminals (file path + terminal count/titles/cwd). On restore, new PTY processes are spawned for each file's terminals. This is a moderate addition.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  ce330b16-0bbf-42d0-8e51-2b236523a967:
    id: ce330b16-0bbf-42d0-8e51-2b236523a967
    content: 'The restore order matters: files must be opened first (filesStore), then panel/browser/terminal state restored and associated. The existing useAppInitialization handles this order but may need adjustment.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  47419b6c-2f3d-45a3-9948-3b8692b8adcb:
