    id: 553aa7bc-4600-4447-93e4-0b807a1132fb
    content: 'Highest defect likelihood: lazy terminal creation timing — the interaction between setActiveFile, panel activeContent check, and async terminalCreate has multiple ordering paths that could misfire'
