    content: 'Terminal cwd validity fallback: the spec suggested checking if a saved cwd exists on disk before creating a terminal. This was not implemented — the underlying node-pty/shell will fall back to home directory if the cwd doesn''t exist, so the risk is low. Marked as abandoned.'
