    content: 'Step 4 (S): update `workflowExecutionActions.sendContentToTerminal` to route `null`-mode to bare send. Ensure `advanceNode` does not wait on feedback for bare sends (auto-complete or auto-advance, decision documented in acceptance criteria — current spec treats it as fire-and-forget)'
