    id: bd222350-0e20-4d48-9093-0dbf6aaea53f
    content: 'Risk: existing autonomous workflow steps relying on default-execute prompting will silently produce worse output after the change. Mitigation: migration prompt surfaces it on file load; changelog warns blueprint authors'
    children: []
