  2fb2ec07-2efe-4185-b535-8df6449a3d8e:
    id: 2fb2ec07-2efe-4185-b535-8df6449a3d8e
    content: 'Edge case: a workflow step with bare-send — the AI has no instruction to write back to a file, so `findNodeIdByFeedbackFilePath` will not match and no auto-accept happens. Document that workflow steps without an applied context act as one-shot sends and do not auto-advance'
    children: []
