    content: 'Ambiguous requirement: bare-send workflow step advancement semantics (fire-and-forget vs auto-complete vs pause). The spec currently says fire-and-forget without auto-advance. If a user relies on auto-advance for a bare step, they will be surprised. Confirm with the product owner before shipping'
