    content: 'Fixes applied in this pass to close two Summary items: added BASIC_REVIEW_CONTEXT_ID synthetic in nodeHelpers.ts with symmetric handling in isSyntheticContextId, resolveContextMode, resolveSendContextName; reinstated DEFAULT_REVIEW_CONTEXT in sendActions.ts with the same `contextPrefix || DEFAULT_*` fallback pattern used for execute so both synthetics produce structured prompts; updated useSetContextSubmenu to set/clear BASIC_REVIEW_CONTEXT_ID like Basic execution instead of treating "no context" as Basic review; added resolveContextMode test for BASIC_REVIEW_CONTEXT_ID; updated existing useSetContextSubmenu tests that asserted the old "(default)" label and null-on-click semantics; filled in the decomposition-flag bare-send test body to assert no OUTPUT FORMAT or INSTRUCTIONS wrapper when the node has decomposition=true but no applied context. Full suite 2701 tests pass, lint clean, typecheck clean on changed files'
