  3d39493e-c37d-4fbb-8518-f3dd2a9893ba:
    id: 3d39493e-c37d-4fbb-8518-f3dd2a9893ba
    content: Verify exhaustively first — audit every node-creation site in the codebase (parseMarkdown, cloneNodesWithNewIds, AcceptFeedbackCommand, PasteNodesCommand, acceptFeedbackArchive, any blueprint instantiation path, any import path) to confirm each uses `uuidv4()`. Scan all tracked `.arbo` fixtures/seeds too. If every path is clean, the "fix" is just marking this verified and closing.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  29be7dcd-559b-41a6-9fd9-99c60591f3f0:
    id: 29be7dcd-559b-41a6-9fd9-99c60591f3f0
    content: 'Non-obvious: the issue is likely already fixed. The user''s opening line ("we might have fixed this") plus the spot-check showing zero title-based ids in current files is strong evidence. Resist the urge to add migration logic proactively. If a specific legacy file with title-based ids surfaces, handle it as a one-off silent normalization on load at that point — not preemptively.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
