  15bb80eb-ab62-4bf5-8896-a189be5fbc3e:
    id: 15bb80eb-ab62-4bf5-8896-a189be5fbc3e
    content: Approach
    children:
      - 071be0df-c2a6-4c73-8bf5-8dd7e0642db5
      - 47d6aa0c-e683-44b0-bf34-99a7f2a6b9c0
      - 5c4adc8f-bc82-4075-8520-2c7afb74e99f
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  071be0df-c2a6-4c73-8bf5-8dd7e0642db5:
    id: 071be0df-c2a6-4c73-8bf5-8dd7e0642db5
    content: Switch focus detection from cached-via-events to an on-demand query. Replace the module-level `windowFocused` variable with `getMainWindow()?.isFocused() ?? false` inside the `is-window-focused` handler. This removes the whole class of bugs where the cache desyncs from the window's real state. Zero risk — it's a simpler, more direct read. Land this first and the "no notifications ever" symptom may disappear.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  47d6aa0c-e683-44b0-bf34-99a7f2a6b9c0:
    id: 47d6aa0c-e683-44b0-bf34-99a7f2a6b9c0
    content: 'Non-obvious: the real fix might be a one-line behavioral change, but the observability problem stays. Add explicit logging at each step of the renderer path: "focus check returned X", "preference state was Y", "called showNotification IPC", and in main "Notification.isSupported=Z, created notification, called .show()". If notifications still fail after the focus fix, the logs will point at which stage silently drops the event.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  5c4adc8f-bc82-4075-8520-2c7afb74e99f:
    id: 5c4adc8f-bc82-4075-8520-2c7afb74e99f
    content: 'Non-obvious: macOS and Linux may have distinct root causes. Treat them as two investigations sharing one instrumentation pass. The focus-tracking fix helps both if it is the bug; the logging pass narrows the next step if not. Avoid shipping a "Linux-specific" path until there is evidence the platform itself is broken, not our code.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
