      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  90858539-e014-48ab-bce8-aa29d2af7682:
    id: 90858539-e014-48ab-bce8-aa29d2af7682
    content: The AI CLI's clear command emits a *different* hook event than its prompt-complete signal; confirmation logic cannot reuse the prompt-complete branch and requires a parallel branch on the clear event
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  cb3cb1f1-213d-4a36-994d-f5a0eb0223c5:
    id: cb3cb1f1-213d-4a36-994d-f5a0eb0223c5
    content: The clear command starts a new underlying session with a new session identifier, invalidating the current session-to-terminal mapping; the clear-complete handler must remap before any subsequent events can be resolved to the running node
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  8f0989df-1bf6-49d3-97a1-e20caa4382d7:
    id: 8f0989df-1bf6-49d3-97a1-e20caa4382d7
    content: The reset command must be dispatched to the specific terminal bound to the running step, not broadcast or routed by any other means
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  dd308807-a630-465a-822e-20ddfa64f16b:
    id: dd308807-a630-465a-822e-20ddfa64f16b
