  045489cf-b38e-4c70-a4ba-e057d1e47ab6:
    id: 045489cf-b38e-4c70-a4ba-e057d1e47ab6
    content: 'UX: the option sits alongside semantic options (decomposition, recurse) but is operationally different (pre-send timing, session-level side effect). Consider grouping or a separator to signal the category difference rather than surfacing it as just another boolean in the same row'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: abandoned
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  619d1bd0-89bf-4280-97dd-4408e8155417:
    id: 619d1bd0-89bf-4280-97dd-4408e8155417
    content: 'UX: silent destruction of unsent user input in the target terminal is a genuine failure mode. Must be disclosed in the tooltip'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  e708a98b-8c9b-4a74-9ca0-0ba41ff3c3a6:
    id: e708a98b-8c9b-4a74-9ca0-0ba41ff3c3a6
    content: 'UX: with multiple terminals open, the user must trust that the reset lands on the right one. Any ambiguity in terminal routing becomes a correctness bug, not a UX niggle'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  a453b137-a4c6-484d-8389-574bd3131d38:
    id: a453b137-a4c6-484d-8389-574bd3131d38
    content: 'Over-engineering guardrail: do not introduce a new "AI session lifecycle" abstraction, a new hook event taxonomy, or a general markdown-stripping pipeline. Scope is one metadata flag + one new hook branch + one remap + correct terminal targeting'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  bc74bf87-7516-40c3-b7f6-ccec50a78c21:
    id: bc74bf87-7516-40c3-b7f6-ccec50a78c21
    content: 'Scope discipline: do not bundle "plain text action mode" or hash-stripping from the ideation list. Those are separate elements if they ever ship'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  470e1fdb-3d55-4fce-b16c-84a3686cac89:
