  ac107919-4d1d-4b09-9f8c-0ae4cec27dd3:
    id: ac107919-4d1d-4b09-9f8c-0ae4cec27dd3
    content: 'Documentation review surfaced a production bug: SessionStart events in the renderer are routed to `registerSession` by useHookEventListener, NOT to `handleHookEvent`. The SessionStart branch I had added to workflowHookEventHandler was therefore dead code and the feature would never have fired in production, despite all tests passing (the tests called handleHookEvent directly)'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  19cad4ab-ba41-46e2-a1db-733893c75abb:
    id: 19cad4ab-ba41-46e2-a1db-733893c75abb
    content: 'Root cause: the hook-server → preload → renderer pipeline did not pass Claude''s `source` field. parseAndValidate in src/main/services/hookServer.ts stripped unknown keys; HookEventPayload types on main and shared sides lacked `source`; useHookEventListener did not forward it; registerSession had no parameter for it'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c7e5391b-06a3-42a8-876c-560d26ddd1e6:
    id: c7e5391b-06a3-42a8-876c-560d26ddd1e6
    content: 'Fix: added `source?: string` to HookEventPayload in src/shared/types/electronApi.ts and src/main/services/hookServer.ts; parseAndValidate now passes source through; preload callback typing extended; useHookEventListener now passes event.source as the 3rd arg to registerSession; registerSession accepts optional source and calls clearSessionManager.onClearConfirmed when source === ''clear''; removed the dead SessionStart branch from workflowHookEventHandler'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  2bc2ec2a-73a2-4b2b-8a8a-8c3c377e51c7:
    id: 2bc2ec2a-73a2-4b2b-8a8a-8c3c377e51c7
    content: Updated clearAiSessionHookHandler.test.ts to test registerSession with various source values (clear / startup / resume / compact / undefined) instead of handleHookEvent; updated clearAiSessionExecution.test.ts "sends prompt after SessionStart" test to call registerSession; updated two existing useHookEventListener tests for the new 3rd-arg arity; added a hookServer test for source passthrough
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  7f3949ab-d1e3-4de6-a793-b3da0d1c304e:
    id: 7f3949ab-d1e3-4de6-a793-b3da0d1c304e
    content: 'Documentation warning: the existing SessionStart hook command in docs/workflows.md did not pass `source` — so even with the feature implemented correctly, existing users who copied the old hook config would never see Clear AI session work. Documentation now shows an updated SessionStart command that uses `jq` to extract source from Claude''s stdin payload and pass it to Arborescent, and the Hook Setup section explains the new jq dependency'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  b7e76e5e-e6f8-477c-bccd-6c491843aeaa:
