  35d5b27b-956f-4d00-8bd8-57c527a11528:
    id: 35d5b27b-956f-4d00-8bd8-57c527a11528
    content: Outcome — all 15 regression tests pass against current master; the reported bug appears already fixed by the FU-2 refactor (0f10148, "extract AcceptFeedback strategies as pure functions"). No feature code was changed — only the new test file was added. Type-check and ESLint pass for the new file. The bug assertion and the deeply-nested end-to-end test (parseMarkdown → AcceptFeedbackCommand) both pass, confirming that new nodes placed deep in the feedback markdown end up at the correct depth and are NOT promoted to the collaborator root's first child. Three `it.todo`-style title-only tests remain as placeholders for scenarios that require a real user-captured fixture to reproduce; skipped the null-input test as it is already covered in sendActions.test.ts.
    children: []
