    id: 59fe9d18-b3f3-4d0a-bba5-f8f1c44666d3
    content: Zoom tabs use a virtual `zoom://<path>#<nodeId>` file path; `storeManager.getStoreForFile` already resolves zoom paths back to the source store via `parseZoomPath`, so the store-lookup hypothesis is weaker than it first looked — root cause is more likely in which element receives focus in zoom mode or which handler runs first
