    id: bc9c27a1-558a-44a2-ace1-af4d1fe3597e
    content: Hotkey context is derived from live DOM focus (not stored panel state), so the "keyboard shortcuts context" fix is an unlikely culprit unless zoom changes where focus lands
    children: []
