  e977ba04-0ca7-4d3a-9161-0b2b007c8102:
    id: e977ba04-0ca7-4d3a-9161-0b2b007c8102
    content: 'Root cause: registerPendingAck arms the ACK timer AFTER the autonomousCollaborate promise resolves; if Claude''s UserPromptSubmit hook fires during that window the ACK is dropped and the 5s timer fires twice (cap of 3 sends) — exactly the observed pattern'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  4f76e9e4-2d99-4ee5-bda1-e2c343c88996:
    id: 4f76e9e4-2d99-4ee5-bda1-e2c343c88996
    content: 'Fix landed in src/renderer/store/tree/actions/workflowExecutionActions.ts: introduced a preconsumedAcks set, split clearPendingAck (cancellation, also drops preconsumes) from a new consumePendingAck (race-tolerant, records preconsume when no entry exists), and made registerPendingAck consume a preconsume marker instead of arming a timer when one is present'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  32229175-ad45-4130-8775-9f173574c548:
    id: 32229175-ad45-4130-8775-9f173574c548
    content: Wired src/renderer/store/tree/actions/workflowHookEventHandler.ts to call consumePendingAck on UserPromptSubmit; disruption reactions still use clearPendingAck (cleanup semantics)
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  db6db9bb-b90d-4b40-bf18-ca591a715c1c:
    id: db6db9bb-b90d-4b40-bf18-ca591a715c1c
    content: 'Failing-then-passing test added in src/renderer/store/tree/actions/tests/workflowUserPromptAck.test.ts under ''Race: ACK arrives before registerPendingAck'' — exercises the exact race by holding the autonomousCollaborate promise pending until after the hook event fires'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
