  e62ac904-b078-4aea-900a-dd5bcdd3b0de:
    id: e62ac904-b078-4aea-900a-dd5bcdd3b0de
    content: Nodes today contain either plain text (where URLs are inert) or, when a URL is pasted, an external-hyperlink node. Hyperlink nodes are filtered out of markdown export, so any node that "is" a link cannot be sent in a workflow or to an AI. The user is forced to choose between clickability and sendability.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  54db977a-7cfb-4044-877e-0e1e63cedee0:
    id: 54db977a-7cfb-4044-877e-0e1e63cedee0
    content: User
    children:
      - e8b91bec-3c9d-4e65-b471-9538003c886f
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  e8b91bec-3c9d-4e65-b471-9538003c886f:
    id: e8b91bec-3c9d-4e65-b471-9538003c886f
    content: Any user authoring nodes that reference external resources — web pages, tickets, internal docs, or files in their editor (vscode://).
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f5c98f00-751e-4cc2-a0c4-7ca326c6d9ef:
    id: f5c98f00-751e-4cc2-a0c4-7ca326c6d9ef
    content: Current experience
    children:
