  f9f7152d-377d-4bbe-8eeb-db167f1afb69:
    id: f9f7152d-377d-4bbe-8eeb-db167f1afb69
    content: Pasting `https://example.com` rewrites the node into a hyperlink-only block, after which sending the parent in a workflow silently drops it. Typing the same URL leaves it as inert text. The user either loses the link in workflows or loses the click in the UI.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
