  8643d313-0b00-4064-aa79-aa4029259f1a:
    id: 8643d313-0b00-4064-aa79-aa4029259f1a
    content: In renderer node-content rendering, scan display text for URL and URI matches and wrap each match in an anchor wired to a click handler that calls shell.openExternal via IPC. Remove the paste-to-hyperlink shortcut for external URLs while keeping internal-hyperlink creation intact. No markdown-export change is needed because plain-text URLs already serialise verbatim.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
