    id: 9deef4d8-3b27-4c17-b8f9-4f94e0ce6835
    content: 'Test pass — 187 tests passing across changed and adjacent surfaces (urlInlineDetection, inlineUrlRender, shellHandlers, clipboardActions, NodeContent, useHyperlinkNavigation, urlHelpers, markdown export and parse). Lint and tsc --noEmit both clean on changed files; the only `import/no-cycle` warning on clipboardPasteHandlers.ts predates this change. Selection flow verified against TreeNode/useNodeMouse: clicks on non-anchor text bubble to the wrapper and trigger selectNode, while anchor clicks stop propagation, so URL click never enters edit mode.'
