  120b472e-74b3-4318-a68e-e78156e3f203:
    id: 120b472e-74b3-4318-a68e-e78156e3f203
    content: Refactor pass — extracted inline-URL logic out of NodeContent.tsx into a new co-located hook src/renderer/components/NodeContent/hooks/useInlineUrl.ts, restoring the "components hold templates only; hooks hold logic" convention. Added src/renderer/components/NodeContent/hooks/tests/useInlineUrl.test.tsx (8 cases) covering the eligibility branches, anchor-only click filtering, openExternal dispatch, propagation suppression, and toast-on-rejection. Replaced the (window as any).electron cast in the NodeContent test with `as unknown as` per the cast convention. 140 tests pass; lint and type-check clean (the pre-existing import/no-cycle warning on clipboardPasteHandlers.ts is unrelated and predates this work).
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f54a4b86-c49b-4a27-acea-4bb6e10f197a:
