    content: 'Documentation pass — added a single CHANGELOG.md entry under Unreleased / Features describing the inline-URL behaviour, the paste-behaviour change, and the explicit non-impact on internal Copy-as-Hyperlink. No docs/ page added or modified: existing docs only reference internal hyperlinks (Copy as Hyperlink in contexts.md, archive provenance in workflows.md), neither of which changed; the new click affordance is implicit and discoverable per the docs convention "if it''s implicit or discoverable and non-blocking, no need to mention it".'
