    content: '`CLAUDE_SESSION_ID` is not an env var Claude Code exports to the bash tool — verified by `env | grep -i claude` showing only `CLAUDECODE`, `CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT`, `CLAUDE_CODE_EXECPATH`'
