  d4f683ca-a723-44cb-88fb-8324931fab12:
    id: d4f683ca-a723-44cb-88fb-8324931fab12
    content: The hook server returns `200 OK` with empty body regardless, so the call looks successful from inside bash but the server cannot match an empty id to any active session and so does not pause the workflow
    children: []
