  7bc148c8-dcc9-4ba8-ac74-aad217ef59d0:
    id: 7bc148c8-dcc9-4ba8-ac74-aad217ef59d0
    content: '`NEEDS_REVIEW_INSTRUCTION` constant in `src/renderer/store/tree/actions/sendActions.ts:142-146` is the only place referencing `${CLAUDE_SESSION_ID}` in the prompt; existing tests in `src/renderer/store/tree/actions/tests/sendActions.test.ts` already assert presence/absence of `ARBORESCENT_HOOK_PORT` so the same file is the natural home for the new tests'
