  8f5e090f-e04d-47f1-9a75-bba494b1d217:
    id: 8f5e090f-e04d-47f1-9a75-bba494b1d217
    content: Other `ARBORESCENT_*` env vars are injected into the terminal subprocess (`src/main/handlers/terminalHandlers.ts`, covered by `src/main/services/tests/terminalEnvInjection.test.ts`); `CLAUDE_SESSION_ID` cannot be added to that env because it is generated by Claude Code AFTER the terminal is spawned — the SessionStart hook is what surfaces it back to Arborescent, which is why the substitution must happen at prompt-construction time, not at terminal-spawn time
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
