  8cdaf000-daaf-44aa-b9b1-a8c78ce54394:
    id: 8cdaf000-daaf-44aa-b9b1-a8c78ce54394
    content: '`docs/contexts.md` rewritten to describe the four states (Collaborate / Execute / Collaborate & Execute / Action) instead of the old single "mode". Action mode''s distinguishing behaviour (context body sent as standalone instruction; no scaffolding, no branch content) is explicit. Built-in **Basic execution** correctly described as Collaborate & Execute (preserves historical implement-and-checkoff behaviour)'
    children: []
