  a632219c-1d7a-4ff3-ae8a-74d86a1553b1:
    id: a632219c-1d7a-4ff3-ae8a-74d86a1553b1
    content: 'Inconsistencies / gaps flagged for the user (small, transitional): (1) the Apply context picker (`useSetContextSubmenu`) currently surfaces only Collaborate and Execute sections — Action contexts created via right-click → Blueprint → Context mode → Action exist on disk and behave correctly when applied, but they don''t appear in the Apply context picker submenu. PR2''s picker rework is the right place to add them. (2) The Send menu item''s tooltip for Both-on contexts now reads "Collaborate & Execute: <name>" — longer than the previous "Execute: <name>", but accurate. Both are minor and intentional consequences of the four-state model'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
