  2906dbbf-6e1a-4ef4-891f-7179c34c38b7:
    id: 2906dbbf-6e1a-4ef4-891f-7179c34c38b7
    content: 🔧 Implementation proposal
    children:
      - 1b740960-7540-43b5-bc7b-d9bc4a0930f6
      - b6875422-c1b5-45e4-897f-1ab1c1af10c9
      - e2cb9713-654a-4120-9791-7b17ce271451
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1b740960-7540-43b5-bc7b-d9bc4a0930f6:
    id: 1b740960-7540-43b5-bc7b-d9bc4a0930f6
    content: 'Approach: replace `metadata.contextMode` with two booleans (`collaborate`, `execute`). The prompt builder appends each flag''s scaffolding block when on; Action mode short-circuits both blocks AND drops the node content. The feedback panel auto-open trigger keys off `collaborate` only. `resolveContextMode` and the `mode` field on `getContextDeclarations` become `resolveContextFlags` returning `{collaborate, execute}`. The four tuples surface as user-facing names (Collaborate / Execute / Collaborate & Execute / Action) on display surfaces; the underlying model stays two booleans'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  b6875422-c1b5-45e4-897f-1ab1c1af10c9:
    id: b6875422-c1b5-45e4-897f-1ab1c1af10c9
    content: 'Touchpoints: node metadata schema and `.arbo` load/save (one-way migration sits here), `nodeHelpers.ts`, `promptBuilder.ts` (compose disjoint blocks; Action short-circuit), feedback panel auto-open trigger, `CustomizeDialog` / `ModeToggle` (two inline checkboxes + "Default: Action / Also ask for ..." copy), `customizeDialogStore` (`selectedCollaborate` / `selectedExecute`), right-click apply-context menu (four named items), built-in context definitions (two presets ship), gutter / context indicators (render Action cleanly), `useWorkflowSubmenu`, `useTerminalActions`, `terminalExecution`, and every test using `contextMode` literals — full grep pre-merge, ~40 files in one PR'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  e2cb9713-654a-4120-9791-7b17ce271451:
    id: e2cb9713-654a-4120-9791-7b17ce271451
    content: 'Constraints to call out: migration must run before any consumer reads context metadata; the disjoint-blocks invariant is the single safety property that makes both-on composition conflict-free, enforced by a one-time pre-merge grep across the two scaffolding authoring sites (Execute block must contain zero list/temp-file rules, Collaborate block must contain zero source-file rules); Action-mode short-circuit must skip both scaffolding blocks AND drop the node content — neither suppression is the prompt builder''s default behaviour; flags inherit down the tree like other context properties; older app versions reading newer files degrade to defaults (accepted forward-compat cost, no shadowed `contextMode` field on save)'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  5281de19-1f7f-49e6-9cac-5daa22bd9eda:
    id: 5281de19-1f7f-49e6-9cac-5daa22bd9eda
    content: Technical refinement
    children:
      - 32ba714b-2c73-447f-873e-0d71b4717b31
      - f294eeed-52d3-4af7-ae9c-cf71dd8648be
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  32ba714b-2c73-447f-873e-0d71b4717b31:
    id: 32ba714b-2c73-447f-873e-0d71b4717b31
    content: Flag complications
    children:
      - 733dca91-fb7b-4940-b3fd-1dfca0361ba8
      - ac360ea2-7b99-4fce-8b2e-d74c40b4b5fb
      - 71266194-8f69-4166-b0f3-818d8e923e27
      - 7bd0fcea-80f8-4893-a878-e4b43da833d9
      - cd158615-0996-4c84-bf41-b05070e54d52
      - ed75b831-1b6a-45c0-9a8d-9d58b41f2a55
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  733dca91-fb7b-4940-b3fd-1dfca0361ba8:
    id: 733dca91-fb7b-4940-b3fd-1dfca0361ba8
    content: Both-on is a prompt combination the AI has never received; if the two scaffolding blocks don't read coherently when concatenated, the AI will pick one and ignore the other — block copy needs a once-over before ship
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  ac360ea2-7b99-4fce-8b2e-d74c40b4b5fb:
    id: ac360ea2-7b99-4fce-8b2e-d74c40b4b5fb
    content: Disjoint-blocks invariant has no automated lint — it's a one-time pre-merge grep. Any later edit that adds a cross-cutting rule to either block silently re-opens the conflict class; worth a line in the PR review checklist
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  71266194-8f69-4166-b0f3-818d8e923e27:
    id: 71266194-8f69-4166-b0f3-818d8e923e27
    content: Action mode is two suppressions in one (skip scaffolding AND drop node content); if either regresses, Action collapses into "scaffolding-off but node-content-on", which is a different user contract — assert both suppressions explicitly
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  7bd0fcea-80f8-4893-a878-e4b43da833d9:
    id: 7bd0fcea-80f8-4893-a878-e4b43da833d9
    content: 'Migration ordering: any reader that touches context metadata before the load-path translator runs (lazy hydration, async store init) will see legacy `contextMode` and miss the new flags; verify the load path is the single entry point'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  cd158615-0996-4c84-bf41-b05070e54d52:
    id: cd158615-0996-4c84-bf41-b05070e54d52
    content: 'Out of scope: forward-compat for older app versions reading newer `.arbo` files (they degrade to defaults — no shadowed field), redesigning the feedback panel itself, changing AI output parsing, layered presets above the booleans'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  ed75b831-1b6a-45c0-9a8d-9d58b41f2a55:
    id: ed75b831-1b6a-45c0-9a8d-9d58b41f2a55
    content: 'ROI sanity: the cost is ~40 files of mechanical re-keying plus the prompt-composition refactor; if either scaffolding block needs significant rewriting to compose coherently, scope creeps — flag early in the PR rather than after merge'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
