    content: '`CHANGELOG.md` — Replaced the "Unified context modes" Unreleased entry with one describing the four-state model (Collaborate, Execute, both, and Action), the inline-checkboxes picker, and the four-named-state context-mode submenu. Treated this as evolving the existing unreleased line rather than adding a redundant entry, per "complement existing documentation" / "remove redundant references".'
