  a6e8e8e3-b32b-426e-886c-19155f523623:
    id: a6e8e8e3-b32b-426e-886c-19155f523623
    content: Context — Arborescent advances to the next workflow step when Claude's main process emits the 'done' hook. When Claude runs a check in a child process (e.g. `yarn test`) and stays idle while watching it, the main process looks done and Arborescent dispatches the next step before the actual work has finished.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  087d6c0d-03c2-40c2-9781-93e1230f4d90:
    id: 087d6c0d-03c2-40c2-9781-93e1230f4d90
    content: User — Arborescent user running multi-step workflows that include shell-executed checks such as build, tests, lint, or type-check
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
