  f7bee38d-f5a6-4016-9601-2a9e27d1cd0c:
    id: f7bee38d-f5a6-4016-9601-2a9e27d1cd0c
    content: 1. Default workflow instructions must direct Claude to run all checks (build, tests, lint, type-check) in the main process so the 'done' signal aligns with real completion.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f470f24d-4953-4356-9472-a32eda51e23d:
    id: f470f24d-4953-4356-9472-a32eda51e23d
    content: 2. If a step requires a long-running command, the instructions must require Claude to wait for it inline in the main process rather than backgrounding and polling.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  94131e54-7ea1-4b08-9eeb-3642ec9b4060:
    id: 94131e54-7ea1-4b08-9eeb-3642ec9b4060
    content: 3. Users can override these defaults on a per-workflow basis when they have a genuine reason to background execution.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f33b7765-5b35-421a-b6b0-c12a65a87cca:
