  9dd08644-562c-49c6-bcf0-ebb048385db3:
    id: 9dd08644-562c-49c6-bcf0-ebb048385db3
    content: Use Electron's `powerSaveBlocker` in the main process, exposed via a small IPC service (`startKeepAwake` / `stopKeepAwake`)
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9208705a-9535-4e96-b2b6-eb33d5c4c7c4:
    id: 9208705a-9535-4e96-b2b6-eb33d5c4c7c4
    content: Workflow runner increments on start and decrements on terminal state (success / failure / cancel); blocker is active iff count > 0
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  24ed22fa-9a04-4b15-9107-736a7958ebe2:
    id: 24ed22fa-9a04-4b15-9107-736a7958ebe2
    content: 'Non-obvious: blocker dies with the main process, so a crash or app quit auto-recovers — no persistent state needed, and the ref count is naturally global across renderer windows since it lives in main'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9a7963f4-d76b-485b-9a35-108e673970b6:
    id: 9a7963f4-d76b-485b-9a35-108e673970b6
    content: 'Implementation notes — service in `src/main/services/keepAwake.ts` (factory + singleton, `prevent-app-suspension`, ref-counted, excess stops clamped). IPC at `keep-awake:start`/`keep-awake:stop`. Renderer wired in `workflowExecutionActions.ts` at startWorkflow / stopWorkflow / completeWorkflow, guarded by existing early-return logic so start/stop pairs match. 9 service unit tests + 10 workflow integration tests; 102/102 pass; lint and tsc clean on changed files. Known edge (deferred): workflows in `awaiting-validation` survive app restart but the keep-awake count resets to 0 with the main process, and `continueWorkflow` does not re-acquire — a resumed-after-restart workflow runs without keep-awake.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
