  44c85bf5-1ff3-49db-9d04-428940e429d7:
    id: 44c85bf5-1ff3-49db-9d04-428940e429d7
    content: 'Diagnosis hypotheses point at server/auth/routing — actual cause is downstream in the renderer: the hook is accepted (200) and logged, but the `NeedsReview` branch only sets a `needsReview: true` flag on the execution entry, with no toast or system notification.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  cb53f62f-51d0-47fc-af69-2934c595977f:
    id: cb53f62f-51d0-47fc-af69-2934c595977f
    content: That flag is only ever consumed when a subsequent `Stop` event arrives AND the step type is `autonomous`. For `manual` or `checkpoint` steps the flag is dead. If the entry's state isn't `running` at the moment `NeedsReview` arrives, the flag isn't even set.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c04a6d9e-e016-4d40-8e75-4859dd6a7592:
    id: c04a6d9e-e016-4d40-8e75-4859dd6a7592
    content: 'This explains the "sometimes works" pattern: it works only when Claude is on an autonomous step and ends its turn cleanly with Stop; otherwise the signal is silently dropped.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  7f367a7a-3910-4f8b-a429-bc44869fcf00:
    id: 7f367a7a-3910-4f8b-a429-bc44869fcf00
    content: 'Out of scope: hook server, auth header form, event-name allowlist, server-side routing — all of these are correct and verified.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  c7874aaa-b68c-42ab-81b7-8c0993a2be67:
    id: c7874aaa-b68c-42ab-81b7-8c0993a2be67
    content: Decide whether `NeedsReview` should fire an immediate user-visible signal across all step types, or stay deferred-until-Stop with a fallback. Choosing wrong risks double-notifications when Stop later arrives on an autonomous step.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1d68a94c-b7b9-4a39-b564-46008c65499f:
