  4f46f008-3b40-4267-84ac-c4ab52933efb:
    id: 4f46f008-3b40-4267-84ac-c4ab52933efb
    content: Change is local to `src/renderer/store/tree/actions/workflowHookEventHandler.ts`, in the `NeedsReview` branch (lines ~92–104) — currently a state mutation only, no UI surface.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
