  c90e5b2c-c8a8-4951-a4d5-dd201bc83dec:
    id: c90e5b2c-c8a8-4951-a4d5-dd201bc83dec
    content: 'Non-obvious: a hyperlink is a reference, not structural content — inheriting `isBlueprint` is misleading because the linked target may not itself be a blueprint, and downstream consumers (blueprint export, blueprint icon resolution) treat the link as part of the blueprint shape'
    children: []
    metadata:
