    id: dee0e013-9499-4f36-9c75-763c110cdffc
    content: copyAsHyperlink never writes to the OS clipboard — its cache lives only in hyperlinkClipboardStore, gated by a one-shot snapshot of the clipboard text taken at copy time
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  aedd8235-f09a-4651-93fc-1cddb0e20136:
    id: aedd8235-f09a-4651-93fc-1cddb0e20136
    content: 'Edge case: navigator.clipboard.readText() in Electron can return stale or empty values without a recent user gesture / focus, defeating the snapshot comparison'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  65fd060d-630d-44f5-b2b2-db58454a5476:
    id: 65fd060d-630d-44f5-b2b2-db58454a5476
    content: 'Edge case: regular copyNodes/cutNodes overwrite the OS clipboard but do not clear the hyperlink cache, so the snapshot stays stale until a paste happens to flush it'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1387b508-982e-4d78-9b60-84a81c9458d3:
