  0dd71bad-22b7-46f9-b2ee-745602954136:
    id: 0dd71bad-22b7-46f9-b2ee-745602954136
    content: 'Root cause sits in clipboardActions.pasteAsHyperlink: it trusts a stale clipboardTextAtCopy snapshot rather than tracking that the clipboard has been touched since copy'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  3e73dab5-5a0e-4400-8735-aeee569ba204:
    id: 3e73dab5-5a0e-4400-8735-aeee569ba204
    content: Fix by invalidating the hyperlink cache on any competing clipboard write (cutNodes / copyNodes) and/or on window focus, instead of relying solely on the equality check at paste time
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  95ecc6f1-560f-47cd-8974-5786c3412952:
    id: 95ecc6f1-560f-47cd-8974-5786c3412952
    content: 'Non-obvious: the regular clipboardCacheStore is already cleared on cut/copy, but the hyperlink store is independent — the two caches need parallel invalidation paths'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
