  890653b8-39b4-468f-8bf9-9856a0faf7a4:
    id: 890653b8-39b4-468f-8bf9-9856a0faf7a4
    content: 'Root cause: `contextDeclarations` is a cached snapshot in the tree store, rebuilt only by `refreshContextDeclarations()` — currently called on declare/remove but not when an existing context node''s label, icon, colour or mode are edited. Restart works because load re-derives the snapshot from nodes.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f759c7f3-c25b-44f3-8ab7-82ee92f46c72:
    id: f759c7f3-c25b-44f3-8ab7-82ee92f46c72
    content: 'Fix lands in `store/tree/actions/contextActions.ts` and the node-edit paths: trigger `refreshContextDeclarations` whenever a node flagged `isContextDeclaration` has its content/icon/colour/mode changed.'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  d54a84a2-55de-4ef5-be4a-97f8f8298086:
    id: d54a84a2-55de-4ef5-be4a-97f8f8298086
    content: 'Alternative worth weighing: drop the cache and derive `contextDeclarations` lazily via a Zustand selector — cleaner, but ripples through every consumer (submenus, send actions, persistence, workflow execution).'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: abandoned
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
