    content: '`ContentEditCommand` now takes an optional `refreshContextDeclarations` callback and invokes it on execute / undo / redo when the edited node has `isContextDeclaration === true`. Icon / colour / mode edits already flowed through `DeclareContextCommand`, which refreshes — so no change needed there.'
