    content: New persisted artefact — the feedback panel record is a separate persisted thing alongside the tree; its schema, file-format placement, and how it survives a tree edit made while the panel is closed-but-persisted all need a concrete answer before implementation.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  bbd79fdc-d4b4-4ab6-8735-d1037b463ab3:
    id: bbd79fdc-d4b4-4ab6-8735-d1037b463ab3
    content: Decomposition-mode detection — the diff utility branches on mode, so the caller must pass the correct mode; mis-tagging a decomposition run as normal feedback would falsely reuse UUIDs across duplicated content.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
