  ac8db58e-9764-4c44-a4bc-a9d882f2fac9:
    id: ac8db58e-9764-4c44-a4bc-a9d882f2fac9
    content: 'Shipped: accept-path UUID retention. `AcceptFeedbackCommand` now accepts an optional `precomputedIdMap`; `sendActions.acceptFeedback` and `sendActions.finishAccept` compute the reconcile output and pass `view.idMap`. Multi-root decomposition still mints fresh UUIDs through the existing path. The two pre-existing acceptance tests in `sendActions.test.ts` were updated to reflect that descendant UUIDs are now inherited (not regenerated) when the new node aligns with a prior one by relative position.'
    children: []
