    content: 'Implemented removed-node visual placeholders. `applyReconciliationMetadata` (`src/renderer/services/feedback/feedbackService.ts`) now injects synthetic `feedback-removed-<priorId>` nodes into the feedback tree at the prior child''s index, carrying `metadata.feedbackBaselineKind: ''removed''` and the prior content. `TreeNode` renders these with a new `feedback-changekind-removed` class (red background + strikethrough on the content). `extractFeedbackContent` strips placeholder nodes and removes them from parent `children` arrays before the proposed subtree reaches `AcceptFeedbackCommand`, so they never land in the main tree on accept.'
