    content: '`src/renderer/store/tree/actions/tests/workflowAutoAccept.test.ts` — new describe block `decomposition multi-root play-forward (PR1)` with 9 `it.todo` placeholders (sequential start in `parsed.rootNodeIds` order, ctor receives the array, single-root path, flash + toast per sibling, sibling-preferred recurse, MAX_RECURSE_ITERATIONS halt mid-sequence, manual / checkpoint pause, single-root no-pending, parse-failure stop). Title-only because the orchestration mechanism (queue, executeCommand sequencing, idMap exposure from AcceptFeedbackCommand) is genuinely uncertain post-fix; the assertions need the implementer to pin those down before bodying them.'
