  84e1d2da-ec86-4e9a-bd50-c8fc71aeba68:
    id: 84e1d2da-ec86-4e9a-bd50-c8fc71aeba68
    content: Today only the original running node is handed to advanceNode, so freshly-created decomposed siblings are left in the step container with no execution state
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  b08cfdd5-2b3d-43dc-8694-d1f31d4fa394:
    id: b08cfdd5-2b3d-43dc-8694-d1f31d4fa394
    content: checkRecurse anchors on findFirstAutonomousStepInChain, which walks backwards to the start of the autonomous chain, so it can skip past siblings still waiting at the last decomposition step
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
