  a608195c-1947-4680-bf98-0b04a3d86604:
    id: a608195c-1947-4680-bf98-0b04a3d86604
    content: 🔧 Implementation proposal
    children:
      - 1fcdaaf0-bab8-45ca-b1aa-cd3686f92fd8
      - 467a304d-0f9e-4403-95a6-ccdcc674f404
      - 3348ea23-3f18-4926-91e5-a74e3a113263
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  1fcdaaf0-bab8-45ca-b1aa-cd3686f92fd8:
    id: 1fcdaaf0-bab8-45ca-b1aa-cd3686f92fd8
    content: Approach — branch inside `exportSelectionAsMarkdown` in `src/renderer/store/tree/actions/clipboardHelpers.ts` (the single funnel used by both `copyNodes` and `cutNodes`). When `selection.type === 'single'` and the node has zero children, return the node's content directly (joining title and body as specified, dropping empty halves). All other paths fall through to today's serializer.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  467a304d-0f9e-4403-95a6-ccdcc674f404:
    id: 467a304d-0f9e-4403-95a6-ccdcc674f404
    content: Touchpoints — `clipboardHelpers.ts` (the branch), tests covering the new leaf path and confirming non-leaf single and multi-select paths are unchanged. `markdown.ts:exportNodeAsMarkdown` is left alone because `nodeHelpers.ts` reuses it for AI-context export. No IPC, main-process, or store-shape changes; `clipboardCacheStore` already handles internal round-trip via cached source nodes.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  3348ea23-3f18-4926-91e5-a74e3a113263:
    id: 3348ea23-3f18-4926-91e5-a74e3a113263
    content: Constraints to call out — internal round-trip relies on `clipboardCacheStore` matching the live clipboard string against its cache to recover the source node references. The new payload must be cached the same way today's markdown is, otherwise paste-back regresses to a no-op (current `parseMarkdown` requires a `#` heading). No new clipboard MIME type is introduced; the "copy in Arborescent → close app → paste back later" path stays as-is (already lossy on status info, not made worse here).
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  aad4ffbd-4ce3-453d-aa98-127da82ee7be:
    id: aad4ffbd-4ce3-453d-aa98-127da82ee7be
    content: Out of scope and deliberate non-goals
    children:
