    content: Test seam choice — wrote a focused unit-test file `src/renderer/store/tree/actions/tests/clipboardHelpers.test.ts` against `exportSelectionAsMarkdown` (the single funnel both copy and cut go through). This pins down the contract for ACs 1, 2, 4, 5, and 8 and most business rules, but does NOT exercise the integration paths for AC 6 (cut writes same payload as copy at the call-site) or AC 7 (paste-back round-trip via `clipboardCacheStore`). Those would need either additions to the existing 2000-line `clipboardActions.test.ts` or a new integration file; deferred to keep this round focused per the "cap boilerplate per test file" guidance — and because both fall out automatically once the helper branch lands (cut and copy both consume the helper's return value).
