  afba3940-55d4-4c71-899c-9a6a19c5a798:
    id: afba3940-55d4-4c71-899c-9a6a19c5a798
    content: Context — when `execute` and `collaborate` were converted to independent booleans on context declarations, the right-click "Apply context" submenu was not updated. It still groups contexts into only two sections — `Collaborate` (collaborate-only) and `Execute` (anything with execute, including both flags) — and silently omits contexts where both flags are false. Users now have four valid flag combinations but a menu that only honours two and a half of them.
    children: []
