  180f82fc-5315-4671-b440-c1f3f2d0a25e:
    id: 180f82fc-5315-4671-b440-c1f3f2d0a25e
    content: '1. Available context declarations must be partitioned into four mutually exclusive groups by their `(execute, collaborate)` flags: `Actions` (both false), `Execute` (execute only), `Collaborate` (collaborate only), `Execute & Collaborate` (both true).'
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  f668a956-650f-4328-a28f-dff727ed04d5:
    id: f668a956-650f-4328-a28f-dff727ed04d5
    content: 2. Each non-empty group renders as a disabled header label followed by the group's contexts; the section order is `Actions`, `Execute`, `Collaborate`, `Execute & Collaborate`.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  b48e24b2-cc58-426f-9799-835e62018410:
    id: b48e24b2-cc58-426f-9799-835e62018410
    content: 3. Sections containing zero contexts must be omitted entirely (header and trailing separator) so the submenu does not show empty headings.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  91a4399b-0e52-4fde-a10b-c316c1ac7bfd:
    id: 91a4399b-0e52-4fde-a10b-c316c1ac7bfd
    content: 4. Built-in `Basic review` and `Basic execution` items keep their current placement and visibility rules — `Basic execution` under `Execute`, `Basic review` under `Collaborate`, both shown only when no inherited context applies.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  6f494bdb-03b5-4072-aaa8-ff983ff69193:
