    content: Result — no blocking issues. Type-check clean, 37/37 tests pass on the touched file. The four-way partition is mutually exclusive, section order matches spec (`Actions, Execute, Collaborate, Execute & Collaborate`), empty sections + their leading separator are correctly skipped, built-ins stay coupled to `Execute`/`Collaborate`, no leading/double/trailing separator, `Close` always last with content (not separator) immediately preceding it. `null`-return path and click semantics preserved. Consumer `useNodeContextMenu.ts` unaffected — return type still `ContextMenuItem[] | null`.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: completed
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
