    content: Minor (rejected) — Suggestion that `buildBasicReviewItem`/`buildBasicExecutionItem` return `ContextMenuItem[]` is a "type smell". These helpers are **pre-existing** (untouched by this diff — the prior implementation also spread them with `...buildBasicReviewItem(...)`) so the shape was not introduced by this PR. Refactoring them would expand scope into unchanged code with no functional benefit. The reviewer correctly tagged it "minor type smell"; the actionable verdict is leave alone.
