  e79c5d7e-da3c-461d-a282-b0b95e9205ed:
    id: e79c5d7e-da3c-461d-a282-b0b95e9205ed
    content: Minor (rejected) — Suggestion to replace the four `availableContexts.filter(...)` passes with a single `reduce`. The current form deliberately co-locates each section's predicate with its `{label, contexts, builtIn}` config so the assembly logic is readable top-down in one pass. A `reduce` would split the partition (separate buckets object) from the section list, requiring readers to cross-reference two structures. Reviewer admits perf is irrelevant. Readability trade-off favours the current form; rejecting.
    children: []
