  69f7edd7-8889-49ee-8bf0-c6233e5c02d7:
    id: 69f7edd7-8889-49ee-8bf0-c6233e5c02d7
    content: '"Sometimes" needs nailing down — the report says intermittent. The fix risk and scope change a lot depending on which path leaks: a plain Manual/Autonomous final step, the post-decomposition advancement path, the recurse iterator''s exit when it runs out of siblings, the 50-iteration safety stop, an autonomous step that completed via auto-accept vs. via terminal-completion hook, or a Checkpoint that the user validated. Worth narrowing the repro before assuming a single root cause.'
    children:
      - 406c02e2-9b22-4541-85d9-58c39730edfb
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  406c02e2-9b22-4541-85d9-58c39730edfb:
