    content: Approach summary
    children:
      - 9b1d7acc-cde2-4704-a364-4210f0963f0d
      - ff7d8312-2dc8-4d41-9350-03da7c2c3d74
      - 9bb9947c-dba3-4fcf-bdcf-3581564a09f1
