  7d55705f-0d22-4920-90e9-24a9c0bd42ad:
    id: 7d55705f-0d22-4920-90e9-24a9c0bd42ad
    content: Workflow-level session pointer — track the workflow's currently-associated session so start-workflow can run the rule-8 check; cleared when liveness reports dead, not when the workflow is marked stopped.
