  9a1e2c98-ae0d-4f85-a95e-88a76f3eb614:
    id: 9a1e2c98-ae0d-4f85-a95e-88a76f3eb614
    content: Three-tier priority decision module at workflow start — (a) focus open tab attached to recorded session, (b) open new tab and resume via CLI's native resume, (c) spawn fresh terminal + session. Keyed on session liveness, independent of workflow status.
