  2bccd219-b524-469b-b793-8354a32c5224:
    id: 2bccd219-b524-469b-b793-8354a32c5224
    content: Recurse traversal applies the same three-tier priority as workflow-start, against the *parent's* session id — (a) send to parent's open attached tab, (b) open new tab and resume parent's session there, (c) spawn fresh + surface broken chain.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  4bab858f-c371-479e-84f9-16a1cacd91a1:
    id: 4bab858f-c371-479e-84f9-16a1cacd91a1
    content: Recursed node inherits parent's session id in cases (a) and (b); records its own new session id in case (c); broken-chain state surfaced via node indicator.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
  9fcd7e9f-267e-4fec-86d3-db3c222134b4:
    id: 9fcd7e9f-267e-4fec-86d3-db3c222134b4
    content: Extend node→terminal pointer rebinding from originator-only (PR1) to *every* node bound to a given session id — descendants refresh atomically with the tab transition, driven by the terminal handler's "session now hosted by tab Y" event.
    children: []
    metadata:
      status: pending
      expanded: true
      deleted: false
      plugins: {}
