    id: 92c099bd-c741-44db-888c-9706effe53b8
    content: Approach — Add a derived `activeSessionNodeId` selector to the tree store that combines existing focused-terminal id with the existing collaboratingNodeId and workflow-session map. TreeNode subscribes selectively and applies a CSS class when its id matches. Pure read-side derivation — no new bindings introduced, only a new visual surface on state already tracked.
