    content: 'Per-render claim verified: useTerminalStore subscription causes all TreeNode function bodies to re-execute on focus change, but Zustand''s Object.is short-circuit keeps React commits scoped to the two flipped nodes; cost is ~200 small Object.entries walks per focus change, well under a frame'
