    content: Two pre-existing set sites (startCollaboration at sendActions.ts:346 and restoreCollaborationState at :609) do NOT set collaborationSource or the new collaboratingTerminalId. Selector requires source === 'terminal' so neither produces incorrect highlight — graceful no-op. Consistent with pre-existing partial-state convention; not in scope to fix
    children: []
