    id: b3397ac5-54e3-4c84-8da4-b5030a6f3fe7
    content: Approach — Add a node-level execute action that fires only when the selection size is exactly one and the single node passes the code test (entire content backticked, no children, no context applied). In that case the node is sent as raw text with backticks stripped through the terminal integration; every other case falls through to the existing markdown send path.
